(2338104, 324430, 15711, '<td valign="top">One of the most beautiful of the challenge.  Her expression is so pure and sweet, yet there is a hint of wonder and even perhaps "another world" to it.  The hands of the unknown person really add to the image. I like that it''s sideways and not dead on straight like so many of the entries.  The green tones send it over the top for me. 10 BRAVO</td>', 'One of the most beautiful of the challenge.  Her expression is so pure and sweet, yet there is a hint of wonder and even perhaps "another world" to it.  The hands of the unknown person really add to the image. I like that it''s sideways and not dead on straight like so many of the entries.  The green tones send it over the top for me. 10 BRAVO', '2006-04-24 02:04:01.000000', NULL, 1),
