(2339316, 324968, 19944, '<td valign="top">Some might say it''s too dark.  I''m not some.  I really like this.</td>', 'Some might say it''s too dark.  I''m not some.  I really like this.', '2006-04-24 13:34:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2339326, 324359, 19944, '<td valign="top">I don''t know why, but I think this is really cool.  Perhaps it''s because I get the feeling that you decided not to let bad weather deter you.  Well done.</td>', 'I don''t know why, but I think this is really cool.  Perhaps it''s because I get the feeling that you decided not to let bad weather deter you.  Well done.', '2006-04-24 13:37:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2339379, 324902, 19944, '<td valign="top">I like this idea of shooting through two windows at once.  Perhaps I may have used it once or twice myself.  I hate to say it, but this iamge may suffer in the voting, as it doesn''t really "pop".  My images suffer that fate quite often.  I hope I''m wrong.</td>', 'I like this idea of shooting through two windows at once.  Perhaps I may have used it once or twice myself.  I hate to say it, but this iamge may suffer in the voting, as it doesn''t really "pop".  My images suffer that fate quite often.  I hope I''m wrong.', '2006-04-24 13:57:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2339385, 325079, 46294, '<td valign="top">The Idea is nice, but there''s nothing interesting framed...</td>', 'The Idea is nice, but there''s nothing interesting framed...', '2006-04-24 13:57:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2339388, 322985, 46294, '<td valign="top">The jepg quality is very low. It could use a bit more contrast</td>', 'The jepg quality is very low. It could use a bit more contrast', '2006-04-24 13:59:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2339390, 324030, 46294, '<td valign="top">Hmmm not a very interesting reflection. Th idea is nice..</td>', 'Hmmm not a very interesting reflection. Th idea is nice..', '2006-04-24 13:59:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2339394, 324196, 51538, '<td valign="top">Simple but effective.</td>', 'Simple but effective.', '2006-04-24 14:01:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2339403, 324876, 39821, '<td valign="top">''Luv the little rascals</td>', '''Luv the little rascals', '2006-04-24 14:05:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2339414, 325017, 46294, '<td valign="top">There''s the Neat Image ghost again....</td>', 'There''s the Neat Image ghost again....', '2006-04-24 14:13:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2339443, 325062, 35947, '<td valign="top">Great idea and well presented!</td>', 'Great idea and well presented!', '2006-04-24 14:22:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2339445, 323718, 35947, '<td valign="top">Wow!  Very cool!</td>', 'Wow!  Very cool!', '2006-04-24 14:22:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2339449, 325079, 55642, '<td valign="top">Because there are clouds outside the window frame, it seems more a picture of a window than of a window <i>framing</i> something. I am also distracted by the trees, particularly along the bottom edge where they could (and should) have been very easily cropped out.</td>', 'Because there are clouds outside the window frame, it seems more a picture of a window than of a window framing something. I am also distracted by the trees, particularly along the bottom edge where they could (and should) have been very easily cropped out.', '2006-04-24 14:24:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2339450, 323806, 35947, '<td valign="top">Sureal looking!  Very cool!</td>', 'Sureal looking!  Very cool!', '2006-04-24 14:25:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2339459, 322356, 53517, '<td valign="top">Really nice, the photo would have been stronger if you had of moved the mountain offcenter.</td>', 'Really nice, the photo would have been stronger if you had of moved the mountain offcenter.', '2006-04-24 14:31:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2339467, 324021, 12448, '<td valign="top">Hi.  Distortion is not what really comes across to me on this shot, it''s more just blurry and no descriptive.  The window frame is unbalanced and really fuzzy.  The shot inside the window fram is rocks or trees?  I can''t really tell and I know I''m probably not supposed to because of the rain {?} on the window?  But there is no color, not defining area to bring or hold my attention to this shot and it lacks interest to me personally.  The colors are muted and the overall shot just looks poor to me.  I''m sorry, but I give this one a 2</td>', 'Hi.  Distortion is not what really comes across to me on this shot, it''s more just blurry and no descriptive.  The window frame is unbalanced and really fuzzy.  The shot inside the window fram is rocks or trees?  I can''t really tell and I know I''m probably not supposed to because of the rain {?} on the window?  But there is no color, not defining area to bring or hold my attention to this shot and it lacks interest to me personally.  The colors are muted and the overall shot just looks poor to me.  I''m sorry, but I give this one a 2', '2006-04-24 14:35:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2339468, 324430, 31133, '<td valign="top">I hope this wins a ribbon!!</td>', 'I hope this wins a ribbon!!', '2006-04-24 14:36:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2339471, 324890, 12448, '<td valign="top">This is interesting in that there are a lot of reflections in the glass that look like other windows and such but overall this really doesn''t hold a lot of interest for me.  It look over sharpened around the edges from all the glow factors, on every line there is a glow line and with all the lines and curves and letters it''s just a confusing jumble to me personally.  My eyes can''t stay on the shot very long because it''s so confusing and nothing is taking me through the shot or holding my attention to it very long.  Sorry, a 3</td>', 'This is interesting in that there are a lot of reflections in the glass that look like other windows and such but overall this really doesn''t hold a lot of interest for me.  It look over sharpened around the edges from all the glow factors, on every line there is a glow line and with all the lines and curves and letters it''s just a confusing jumble to me personally.  My eyes can''t stay on the shot very long because it''s so confusing and nothing is taking me through the shot or holding my attention to it very long.  Sorry, a 3', '2006-04-24 14:37:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2339479, 324312, 12448, '<td valign="top">What an interesting place for a statue and such.  Not really sure about the window framed content, I''m guessing you''re talking about the arch around the statue.  It''s not a bad shot per say but nothing here really holds my interest for very long and the lighting is very harsh.  The colors also look a bit off, especially on the right side of the rock the statue is on.  The border does nothing for this shot, the blue is much too dark but I don''t vote according to borders but I know of several others who do.  If the lighting was softer, the colors were more consistant and I saw more of a "window framed" idea this would at least be a 5 or 6 but as is a 3, sorry</td>', 'What an interesting place for a statue and such.  Not really sure about the window framed content, I''m guessing you''re talking about the arch around the statue.  It''s not a bad shot per say but nothing here really holds my interest for very long and the lighting is very harsh.  The colors also look a bit off, especially on the right side of the rock the statue is on.  The border does nothing for this shot, the blue is much too dark but I don''t vote according to borders but I know of several others who do.  If the lighting was softer, the colors were more consistant and I saw more of a "window framed" idea this would at least be a 5 or 6 but as is a 3, sorry', '2006-04-24 14:42:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2339487, 325077, 12448, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea but there are several things here competing for my attention, the bars in the front, the benches on the terrace, the rail on the terrace, the stairs on the other side, the windows on the other side, all fighting each other and offering a jumbled overall distracting shot.  The lighting is also very unbalanced and the hot spot in the upper right middle is very distracting.  It''s pulling my attention more than anything else.  Maybe if you came back from the window a bit and up, so you had just the bottom of the terrace rail with the stairs across the way?  Also less time on the exposure so the lights in the stairwell don''t cause such a hot spot?  Sorry, as is, a 3</td>', 'Interesting idea but there are several things here competing for my attention, the bars in the front, the benches on the terrace, the rail on the terrace, the stairs on the other side, the windows on the other side, all fighting each other and offering a jumbled overall distracting shot.  The lighting is also very unbalanced and the hot spot in the upper right middle is very distracting.  It''s pulling my attention more than anything else.  Maybe if you came back from the window a bit and up, so you had just the bottom of the terrace rail with the stairs across the way?  Also less time on the exposure so the lights in the stairwell don''t cause such a hot spot?  Sorry, as is, a 3', '2006-04-24 14:45:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2339488, 323708, 12448, '<td valign="top">This is wonderful, it would have worked so well for Candid as well.  I can''t tell what is in his hand but it''s compelling and making me want to find out.  It''s telling me a story, giving me a glimpse into another''s life and the framing and coloration used is very well done.  A 9</td>', 'This is wonderful, it would have worked so well for Candid as well.  I can''t tell what is in his hand but it''s compelling and making me want to find out.  It''s telling me a story, giving me a glimpse into another''s life and the framing and coloration used is very well done.  A 9', '2006-04-24 14:46:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2339494, 324784, 12448, '<td valign="top">This looks like Nasti!  I love this shot!  The windmill in the reflection on top, the look on the person''s face, can''t quite explain it, it''s a quiet, reflective, thoughtful look.  Like she''s zoning out and just being, very well done.  The only thing that bothers me and it''s nit picky is the hands, for some reason they don''t look quite natural, the front one is okay but the other one just seems off for some reason.  A 9</td>', 'This looks like Nasti!  I love this shot!  The windmill in the reflection on top, the look on the person''s face, can''t quite explain it, it''s a quiet, reflective, thoughtful look.  Like she''s zoning out and just being, very well done.  The only thing that bothers me and it''s nit picky is the hands, for some reason they don''t look quite natural, the front one is okay but the other one just seems off for some reason.  A 9', '2006-04-24 14:49:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2339504, 325090, 55642, '<td valign="top">Needs to be rotated slightly counterclockwise, but beautiful. I had this idea myself and passed on it for lack of time.</td>', 'Needs to be rotated slightly counterclockwise, but beautiful. I had this idea myself and passed on it for lack of time.', '2006-04-24 14:54:01.000000', NULL, 1),
