(2341527, 324872, 30364, '<td valign="top">Very good; interesting and challenging.  It''s like a clever puzzle, filled with clues, hints and apparent contradictions.  And like a really good puzzle, the solving is at least as satisfying as is the actual solution.  Well done.  9.</td>', 'Very good; interesting and challenging.  It''s like a clever puzzle, filled with clues, hints and apparent contradictions.  And like a really good puzzle, the solving is at least as satisfying as is the actual solution.  Well done.  9.', '2006-04-25 09:47:09.000000', NULL, 1),
