(2341936, 324141, 42100, '<td valign="top">The arch window is an interesting choice to use for framing, but in this photo it really isn''t framing the subject very well.  In fact it''s doing more to obscure it than frame it.  Moving a bit to your right would of positioned the house nicely in that right pie poriton of the arch.</td>', 'The arch window is an interesting choice to use for framing, but in this photo it really isn''t framing the subject very well.  In fact it''s doing more to obscure it than frame it.  Moving a bit to your right would of positioned the house nicely in that right pie poriton of the arch.', '2006-04-25 11:58:09.000000', NULL, 1),
