(2342489, 325100, 20235, '<td valign="top">Very nice. The composition is great with the large door frame really emphasizing the smallness of the child. The one element I find distracting is the reflection of the pick-up truck roofline in the glass. It appears to just cut right through your main subject and detracts from the emotive quality somewhat. But nice shot nonetheless.... My vote is a 7</td>', 'Very nice. The composition is great with the large door frame really emphasizing the smallness of the child. The one element I find distracting is the reflection of the pick-up truck roofline in the glass. It appears to just cut right through your main subject and detracts from the emotive quality somewhat. But nice shot nonetheless.... My vote is a 7', '2006-04-25 15:26:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2342497, 323533, 20235, '<td valign="top">I really like this photo and the creative direction you took with it. The composition and color pallete work well for me. However, the focus seems a tad soft in all areas and the lighting appears to be distributed unevenly to create shadowing in some areas while appearing harsh in others. Nice shot nonetheless... my vote is a 7</td>', 'I really like this photo and the creative direction you took with it. The composition and color pallete work well for me. However, the focus seems a tad soft in all areas and the lighting appears to be distributed unevenly to create shadowing in some areas while appearing harsh in others. Nice shot nonetheless... my vote is a 7', '2006-04-25 15:29:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2342500, 323053, 20235, '<td valign="top">I really like the composition and perspective you used here. The photo itself is full of contrasts, texture, and layers. Very nice.... 7</td>', 'I really like the composition and perspective you used here. The photo itself is full of contrasts, texture, and layers. Very nice.... 7', '2006-04-25 15:29:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2342502, 325137, 20235, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and use of lines here. Your decision to desaturate the photo was a brave one, but works well in this case to move the focus towards the textures and lines... 7</td>', 'Nice composition and use of lines here. Your decision to desaturate the photo was a brave one, but works well in this case to move the focus towards the textures and lines... 7', '2006-04-25 15:30:12.000000', NULL, 1),
