(2343377, 325078, 42013, '<td valign="top">hard to look at, but funny</td>', 'hard to look at, but funny', '2006-04-25 22:10:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2343381, 324139, 42198, '<td valign="top">Beautiful composition. Great expression on her face, there must have been something really interesting down there holding her attention!<br/> <br/>Good post-processing as well, the hue creates a nice mood here. The only thing I wasn''t sure about at first was the blurred background, but it kind of grows on you. The three flowers break it up nicely.<br/> <br/>(Hang on a minute, a flower AND a baby in the same shot? 1 from me!)  :)</td>', 'Beautiful composition. Great expression on her face, there must have been something really interesting down there holding her attention! Good post-processing as well, the hue creates a nice mood here. The only thing I wasn''t sure about at first was the blurred background, but it kind of grows on you. The three flowers break it up nicely. (Hang on a minute, a flower AND a baby in the same shot? 1 from me!)  :)', '2006-04-25 22:11:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2343385, 325128, 42013, '<td valign="top">Nice job with the lighting although the rim of the glass has disappeard on my monitor.  Nice color choice on the shirt.<br/> <br/>I dont profess to be expert on photographing wine, but a helpful tip was given to me which said to heavily dilute the wine with water to allow some light to pass.  but who wants to spoil good wine? :)</td>', 'Nice job with the lighting although the rim of the glass has disappeard on my monitor.  Nice color choice on the shirt. I dont profess to be expert on photographing wine, but a helpful tip was given to me which said to heavily dilute the wine with water to allow some light to pass.  but who wants to spoil good wine? :)', '2006-04-25 22:12:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2343387, 324359, 42013, '<td valign="top">very impressionistic</td>', 'very impressionistic', '2006-04-25 22:12:26.000000', NULL, 1),
