(2350240, 324858, 32885, '<td valign="top">I am not sure why someone would want in through a bathroom window?</td>', 'I am not sure why someone would want in through a bathroom window?', '2006-04-27 10:49:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2350242, 324748, 32885, '<td valign="top">What a grand image. I can feel the cold from here! I love the clarity.</td>', 'What a grand image. I can feel the cold from here! I love the clarity.', '2006-04-27 10:49:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2350245, 323897, 32885, '<td valign="top">This brought a smile to my face...bumped.</td>', 'This brought a smile to my face...bumped.', '2006-04-27 10:50:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2350325, 324511, 50640, '<td valign="top">This is wonderful in regard to composition and exposure. Good luck.</td>', 'This is wonderful in regard to composition and exposure. Good luck.', '2006-04-27 11:21:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2350342, 324885, 50640, '<td valign="top">I like it a lot and would have rated it higher but it seems a bit out of focus. (Although perhaps this was the desired effect.) Good luck.</td>', 'I like it a lot and would have rated it higher but it seems a bit out of focus. (Although perhaps this was the desired effect.) Good luck.', '2006-04-27 11:26:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2350399, 324453, 50641, '<td valign="top">Really great idea!  I''m finding the pattern on the glass and on the orchids to be a little bit of sensory overload.  I wonder how this would look with reduced sharpness or with either the plants or glass having less complexity.  Love the weathered window frame and the old latch.</td>', 'Really great idea!  I''m finding the pattern on the glass and on the orchids to be a little bit of sensory overload.  I wonder how this would look with reduced sharpness or with either the plants or glass having less complexity.  Love the weathered window frame and the old latch.', '2006-04-27 11:56:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2350406, 324030, 50641, '<td valign="top">I like the pink flower :)  The windows are reflecting well, and their smoothness contrasts nicely with the rocky wall. I''m not crazy about the shingly roof pieces.  Next time, you might consider ''planting'' a reflection of something interesting in the window, and brightening the whole pic by using levels and/or curves.  Just some thoughts ;-)</td>', 'I like the pink flower :)  The windows are reflecting well, and their smoothness contrasts nicely with the rocky wall. I''m not crazy about the shingly roof pieces.  Next time, you might consider ''planting'' a reflection of something interesting in the window, and brightening the whole pic by using levels and/or curves.  Just some thoughts ;-)', '2006-04-27 12:01:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2350413, 324404, 50641, '<td valign="top">Lucky you!  Part of me wishes I could see the greens that must be here, but perhaps you used duotones to minimize something you didn''t like?  If it were mine, I might tweak the curves a bit to get more range of tone - and try a non-yellowy hue to make this gorgeous vista look more vibrant.</td>', 'Lucky you!  Part of me wishes I could see the greens that must be here, but perhaps you used duotones to minimize something you didn''t like?  If it were mine, I might tweak the curves a bit to get more range of tone - and try a non-yellowy hue to make this gorgeous vista look more vibrant.', '2006-04-27 12:06:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2350418, 324420, 50641, '<td valign="top">Funny - and now you have 2 x 1/2...  Wish I could see the face a little more clearly - or maybe more expression?  The background behind him looks pretty extreme, kind of x-files. Appreciate the creative spin.</td>', 'Funny - and now you have 2 x 1/2...  Wish I could see the face a little more clearly - or maybe more expression?  The background behind him looks pretty extreme, kind of x-files. Appreciate the creative spin.', '2006-04-27 12:11:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2350425, 323499, 50641, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.  Very interesting mix of sat and desat.  Just fyi, you have some post-processing boogers near the purple flower - can see the unblurred background near the petals and the stems.  (I have trouble getting this kind of stuff to be clean too.)</td>', 'Nice idea.  Very interesting mix of sat and desat.  Just fyi, you have some post-processing boogers near the purple flower - can see the unblurred background near the petals and the stems.  (I have trouble getting this kind of stuff to be clean too.)', '2006-04-27 12:15:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2350521, 324076, 46177, '<td valign="top">Love the selective desat. 9</td>', 'Love the selective desat. 9', '2006-04-27 12:33:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2350535, 325005, 46177, '<td valign="top">Wow. Gorgeous!9</td>', 'Wow. Gorgeous!9', '2006-04-27 12:35:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2350545, 325062, 46177, '<td valign="top">Stunning! 0</td>', 'Stunning! 0', '2006-04-27 12:36:11.000000', NULL, 1),
