(2350610, 324784, 22689, '<td valign="top">This one is very interesting , I like the way you "split" in 2 the window with the reflect of the landscape on the upper top and the melancholy face.<br/>Really nice composition !</td>', 'This one is very interesting , I like the way you "split" in 2 the window with the reflect of the landscape on the upper top and the melancholy face.Really nice composition !', '2006-04-27 12:44:09.000000', NULL, 1),
