(2351281, 323467, 50641, '<td valign="top">Good choice of window. Interesting how the 3 panes have no overlap.  Those sure are some funky-looking clouds - is the glass distorting them or is that post-processing?</td>', 'Good choice of window. Interesting how the 3 panes have no overlap.  Those sure are some funky-looking clouds - is the glass distorting them or is that post-processing?', '2006-04-27 17:55:15.000000', NULL, 1),
