(2355071, 324430, 13719, '<td valign="top">Very cool and freaky shot you have here. I like how you have the hands on the other side of the window but thats all you show, thats very cool and adds something to the photo to me. I like the coloring also, kind of looks like a very old image</td>', 'Very cool and freaky shot you have here. I like how you have the hands on the other side of the window but thats all you show, thats very cool and adds something to the photo to me. I like the coloring also, kind of looks like a very old image', '2006-04-29 01:42:28.000000', NULL, 1),
