(2355377, 325132, 39484, '<td valign="top">This is framed in an original way and the subject stands out well.</td>', 'This is framed in an original way and the subject stands out well.', '2006-04-29 03:15:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2355386, 325078, 39484, '<td valign="top">This image is great.  I am afraid of what the average DPC voter will do to it given its size, large boarder and abstract nature.  10.</td>', 'This image is great.  I am afraid of what the average DPC voter will do to it given its size, large boarder and abstract nature.  10.', '2006-04-29 03:17:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2355393, 324113, 39484, '<td valign="top">Good exposure.  Would be great if the man''s face was not as cut off by the framing.  nice work.</td>', 'Good exposure.  Would be great if the man''s face was not as cut off by the framing.  nice work.', '2006-04-29 03:19:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2355401, 324692, 39484, '<td valign="top">Nice subject.  It feels like the subject is the window rather than the thing that is framing the subject.  Good work.</td>', 'Nice subject.  It feels like the subject is the window rather than the thing that is framing the subject.  Good work.', '2006-04-29 03:21:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2355406, 324876, 39484, '<td valign="top">Great subject choice.  Good capture of a slice of life.</td>', 'Great subject choice.  Good capture of a slice of life.', '2006-04-29 03:22:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2355414, 324862, 39484, '<td valign="top">I like the vertical orientation.</td>', 'I like the vertical orientation.', '2006-04-29 03:24:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2355417, 324641, 39484, '<td valign="top">Nice mood, color palette and narrative.</td>', 'Nice mood, color palette and narrative.', '2006-04-29 03:25:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2355420, 324647, 39484, '<td valign="top">Great job and subject choice.  I like the exposure.</td>', 'Great job and subject choice.  I like the exposure.', '2006-04-29 03:25:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2355423, 324853, 39484, '<td valign="top">Nice vintage feel.</td>', 'Nice vintage feel.', '2006-04-29 03:26:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2355434, 324110, 39484, '<td valign="top">This is nice and it pops like a dpc winner.  I think the composition feels a bit uneasy, but I''m not sure.  Great work!!</td>', 'This is nice and it pops like a dpc winner.  I think the composition feels a bit uneasy, but I''m not sure.  Great work!!', '2006-04-29 03:29:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2355437, 323602, 39484, '<td valign="top">10 bucks you get a ton of comments like, "This is not a window".  :)  Nice photo</td>', '10 bucks you get a ton of comments like, "This is not a window".  :)  Nice photo', '2006-04-29 03:29:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2355441, 324892, 39484, '<td valign="top">Nice take on the challenge.  I think the foreground needs to be a bit sharper.  Good job.</td>', 'Nice take on the challenge.  I think the foreground needs to be a bit sharper.  Good job.', '2006-04-29 03:31:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2355446, 324139, 39484, '<td valign="top">This is a gorgeous shot with a nice warm tone.  Especially given the challenge, it is a shame the frame does not extend around the entire image.  Nice capture.</td>', 'This is a gorgeous shot with a nice warm tone.  Especially given the challenge, it is a shame the frame does not extend around the entire image.  Nice capture.', '2006-04-29 03:33:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2355454, 324430, 39484, '<td valign="top">I like the tonal palette.</td>', 'I like the tonal palette.', '2006-04-29 03:36:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2355456, 325116, 39484, '<td valign="top">Scary and well conceived.</td>', 'Scary and well conceived.', '2006-04-29 03:36:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2355459, 323565, 39484, '<td valign="top">Nice contemplative mood.</td>', 'Nice contemplative mood.', '2006-04-29 03:36:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2355465, 324030, 39484, '<td valign="top">I like banal subjects.  I''m feeling like the window is supposed to frame a subject.  To me the reflection of the house can not compete with the window it self.</td>', 'I like banal subjects.  I''m feeling like the window is supposed to frame a subject.  To me the reflection of the house can not compete with the window it self.', '2006-04-29 03:38:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2355467, 324234, 39484, '<td valign="top">Original concept.  Good work.</td>', 'Original concept.  Good work.', '2006-04-29 03:39:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2355476, 322264, 39484, '<td valign="top">Great view.  That latitude with the challenge theme will certainly result in a certain amount of low scores.  I also would have liked the opening to really frame the image more.  Crop in and catch the top of the porch to close off the frame.  You should definitely revisit the tree as a subject if possible, perhaps from a similar vantage point.</td>', 'Great view.  That latitude with the challenge theme will certainly result in a certain amount of low scores.  I also would have liked the opening to really frame the image more.  Crop in and catch the top of the porch to close off the frame.  You should definitely revisit the tree as a subject if possible, perhaps from a similar vantage point.', '2006-04-29 03:42:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2355477, 323364, 39484, '<td valign="top">I like the repeating motive of the semi-circle.</td>', 'I like the repeating motive of the semi-circle.', '2006-04-29 03:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2355480, 325120, 39484, '<td valign="top">This is a fine concept.  Graphically speaking, my eye is does not feel comfortable with the subject.  Nice to see someone trying something new.</td>', 'This is a fine concept.  Graphically speaking, my eye is does not feel comfortable with the subject.  Nice to see someone trying something new.', '2006-04-29 03:44:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2355485, 323499, 55738, '<td valign="top">I think it would have even been better with out the sheer on the left side of the frame...</td>', 'I think it would have even been better with out the sheer on the left side of the frame...', '2006-04-29 03:45:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2355486, 323467, 39484, '<td valign="top">Great color and exposure.  The way the elements are separated really help the image meet the challenge in a striking way. 10</td>', 'Great color and exposure.  The way the elements are separated really help the image meet the challenge in a striking way. 10', '2006-04-29 03:45:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2355493, 324616, 39484, '<td valign="top">This has lots of potential.  It seems like you should have waited to much later (or earlier) in the day to shoot this in order to get a more dynamic sky or at least one that is not so easily blown out.</td>', 'This has lots of potential.  It seems like you should have waited to much later (or earlier) in the day to shoot this in order to get a more dynamic sky or at least one that is not so easily blown out.', '2006-04-29 03:47:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2355496, 324141, 39484, '<td valign="top">I like the contrast.</td>', 'I like the contrast.', '2006-04-29 03:47:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2355503, 324712, 39484, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure this is a window, but the subject is so beautifully exotic it deserves a 10.  Great light and framing.</td>', 'I''m not sure this is a window, but the subject is so beautifully exotic it deserves a 10.  Great light and framing.', '2006-04-29 03:48:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2355504, 323946, 39484, '<td valign="top">Great concept piece. 10</td>', 'Great concept piece. 10', '2006-04-29 03:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2355506, 324511, 39484, '<td valign="top">Feels cold.  Good narrative.</td>', 'Feels cold.  Good narrative.', '2006-04-29 03:49:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2355515, 323608, 39484, '<td valign="top">I like the minimalism.  When the depth of field causes foreground elements to be soft, you run the risk of having its mere presence in the front drawing too much attention.  Additionally, the frame is the element of highest contrast, giving it too much weight to be so soft IMO.  Good subject selection.</td>', 'I like the minimalism.  When the depth of field causes foreground elements to be soft, you run the risk of having its mere presence in the front drawing too much attention.  Additionally, the frame is the element of highest contrast, giving it too much weight to be so soft IMO.  Good subject selection.', '2006-04-29 03:52:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2355522, 323686, 39484, '<td valign="top">This is pretty surreal.  Nice setup, or is the window always floating there? :)</td>', 'This is pretty surreal.  Nice setup, or is the window always floating there? :)', '2006-04-29 03:54:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2355523, 324789, 39484, '<td valign="top">This is fantastic.  Great color and contrast. 10</td>', 'This is fantastic.  Great color and contrast. 10', '2006-04-29 03:54:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2355524, 324177, 39484, '<td valign="top">Nice narrative.</td>', 'Nice narrative.', '2006-04-29 03:55:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2355528, 322536, 39484, '<td valign="top">Nice view.  Is the photo at its maximum size?  If not, it could have even more impact if biiger.</td>', 'Nice view.  Is the photo at its maximum size?  If not, it could have even more impact if biiger.', '2006-04-29 03:56:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2355530, 325020, 39484, '<td valign="top">Great minimal palette and composition. 10</td>', 'Great minimal palette and composition. 10', '2006-04-29 03:56:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2355534, 324980, 39484, '<td valign="top">Great subjects.  I would have liked to have the concrete even around the bars.  great job . 10</td>', 'Great subjects.  I would have liked to have the concrete even around the bars.  great job . 10', '2006-04-29 03:57:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2355535, 324946, 39484, '<td valign="top">Nice color and subject management.</td>', 'Nice color and subject management.', '2006-04-29 03:57:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2355539, 324541, 39484, '<td valign="top">Nice color and subject.  Things feel a bit staged or placed.  good work.</td>', 'Nice color and subject.  Things feel a bit staged or placed.  good work.', '2006-04-29 03:58:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2355541, 323718, 39484, '<td valign="top">Strong and imposing subject.  The B and W works well.</td>', 'Strong and imposing subject.  The B and W works well.', '2006-04-29 03:59:28.000000', NULL, 1),
