(2356217, 325046, 46288, '<td valign="top">Good composition.</td>', 'Good composition.', '2006-04-29 08:30:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2356218, 324872, 56797, '<td valign="top">I enjoy the distortion but i dont know if I wouldnt have been able to figure out that this was the inside of a church without the title.</td>', 'I enjoy the distortion but i dont know if I wouldnt have been able to figure out that this was the inside of a church without the title.', '2006-04-29 08:31:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2356221, 324107, 56797, '<td valign="top">im sure you wanted the viewer to notice the window trim but i would have preffered a closer crop on the frame containing the face. otherwise. nice photo!</td>', 'im sure you wanted the viewer to notice the window trim but i would have preffered a closer crop on the frame containing the face. otherwise. nice photo!', '2006-04-29 08:33:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2356224, 324359, 56797, '<td valign="top">cleaner rearwindow or better wiper would have done wonders for this shot. has potential!</td>', 'cleaner rearwindow or better wiper would have done wonders for this shot. has potential!', '2006-04-29 08:34:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2356226, 324110, 20889, '<td valign="top">This would make a killer black and white even without the window frame in it.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-05-01 15:24:10.</i></td>', 'This would make a killer black and white even without the window frame in it.', '2006-04-29 08:35:17.000000', '2006-05-01 16:24:10.000000', 1),
(2356228, 323522, 56797, '<td valign="top">beautiful building. some added contrast would improve it greatly</td>', 'beautiful building. some added contrast would improve it greatly', '2006-04-29 08:35:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2356230, 325102, 56797, '<td valign="top">I enjoy your use of black and white framed by color. the cut off object on the left hand side is a bit distracting. i would have chosen a closer crop. otherwise great photo.</td>', 'I enjoy your use of black and white framed by color. the cut off object on the left hand side is a bit distracting. i would have chosen a closer crop. otherwise great photo.', '2006-04-29 08:37:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2356247, 324943, 7703, '<td valign="top">This is clever, I did think about something like this but did not find any window to take with me.<br/>I though would have liked if you had shoot straight at the frame.</td>', 'This is clever, I did think about something like this but did not find any window to take with me.I though would have liked if you had shoot straight at the frame.', '2006-04-29 08:46:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2356250, 324177, 7703, '<td valign="top">Cliche idea :) would have worked with less reflections.</td>', 'Cliche idea :) would have worked with less reflections.', '2006-04-29 08:47:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2356252, 323515, 7703, '<td valign="top">I am sorry to say but this idea is not good. To much distraction in it.</td>', 'I am sorry to say but this idea is not good. To much distraction in it.', '2006-04-29 08:48:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2356254, 324812, 7703, '<td valign="top">I would like to see the whole frame or less of it (crop of on the right side) ... nice frame you found.</td>', 'I would like to see the whole frame or less of it (crop of on the right side) ... nice frame you found.', '2006-04-29 08:49:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2356273, 323708, 56047, '<td valign="top">Very nice capture of a "slice of life" moment. This works quite well in B&amp;W. I might have considered tightening the crop a bit on the left so that the couple fills the frame a bit more - this would help maintain your focus on the main subjects.</td>', 'Very nice capture of a "slice of life" moment. This works quite well in B&W. I might have considered tightening the crop a bit on the left so that the couple fills the frame a bit more - this would help maintain your focus on the main subjects.', '2006-04-29 08:55:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2356274, 325062, 7703, '<td valign="top">I like the black and white frames better then the center. And somewhere in they rules they say that it is not alowed to take photo of someones else art.</td>', 'I like the black and white frames better then the center. And somewhere in they rules they say that it is not alowed to take photo of someones else art.', '2006-04-29 08:55:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2356276, 324793, 20889, '<td valign="top">Nice black and white.</td>', 'Nice black and white.', '2006-04-29 08:55:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2356281, 324792, 56047, '<td valign="top">Great use of lighting and shadows, which sets up a nice mood. The slats across his face gives this an air of mystery that really adds a lot to the photo.</td>', 'Great use of lighting and shadows, which sets up a nice mood. The slats across his face gives this an air of mystery that really adds a lot to the photo.', '2006-04-29 08:56:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2356284, 325071, 7703, '<td valign="top">Frame is tilted to the right, also I would like to see more of the frame.</td>', 'Frame is tilted to the right, also I would like to see more of the frame.', '2006-04-29 08:57:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2356288, 324139, 56047, '<td valign="top">Really wonderful capture of a nice moment. I like the overall composition of the little girl off centered within the frame, and I think she has a very natural pose as she looks out the window. Its unfortunate that the top of the frame was cut off, although perhaps there was some elements outside of the frame that you chose to exclude.</td>', 'Really wonderful capture of a nice moment. I like the overall composition of the little girl off centered within the frame, and I think she has a very natural pose as she looks out the window. Its unfortunate that the top of the frame was cut off, although perhaps there was some elements outside of the frame that you chose to exclude.', '2006-04-29 08:58:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2356291, 324692, 7703, '<td valign="top">Like this idea ... black and white works well and realy the extra frame do add alot to the photo.</td>', 'Like this idea ... black and white works well and realy the extra frame do add alot to the photo.', '2006-04-29 08:59:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2356299, 325015, 7703, '<td valign="top">To much filters or edition for me in this challenge but looks great just if it was in your portfolio. :)</td>', 'To much filters or edition for me in this challenge but looks great just if it was in your portfolio. :)', '2006-04-29 09:00:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2356300, 324872, 7703, '<td valign="top">Loks like some painting but it is to much happening in this photo.</td>', 'Loks like some painting but it is to much happening in this photo.', '2006-04-29 09:01:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2356301, 324616, 7703, '<td valign="top">I would have want to see straight-on photo. Taken to much from the right</td>', 'I would have want to see straight-on photo. Taken to much from the right', '2006-04-29 09:02:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2356302, 324631, 7703, '<td valign="top">Glasses are not window, so you do not meet the challenge.</td>', 'Glasses are not window, so you do not meet the challenge.', '2006-04-29 09:02:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2356303, 323565, 56047, '<td valign="top">You caught a very nice mood here. Backlighting is always difficult, but you have nice control of your highlights ansd shadow detail, resulting in a pleasant photo. I think I might have considered pointing the camera a bit more to the right, so that the window is centered in the frame and the subject is a bit more off centered to the left - the empty wall to the left looks a bit odd, compositionally, to my eye...</td>', 'You caught a very nice mood here. Backlighting is always difficult, but you have nice control of your highlights ansd shadow detail, resulting in a pleasant photo. I think I might have considered pointing the camera a bit more to the right, so that the window is centered in the frame and the subject is a bit more off centered to the left - the empty wall to the left looks a bit odd, compositionally, to my eye...', '2006-04-29 09:03:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2356304, 323746, 7703, '<td valign="top">this is good photo, looks just great.</td>', 'this is good photo, looks just great.', '2006-04-29 09:03:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2356306, 325139, 7703, '<td valign="top">Why don''t you show us the whole frame? It is not enough to have naked girl in your photo to win ;)</td>', 'Why don''t you show us the whole frame? It is not enough to have naked girl in your photo to win ;)', '2006-04-29 09:04:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2356308, 324066, 7703, '<td valign="top">The contrast between inside and outside are just great and works well.</td>', 'The contrast between inside and outside are just great and works well.', '2006-04-29 09:04:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2356309, 324072, 7703, '<td valign="top">The theme in this challenge was to frame something and in your photo there is not much interesting happening inside the frame.</td>', 'The theme in this challenge was to frame something and in your photo there is not much interesting happening inside the frame.', '2006-04-29 09:05:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2356311, 323364, 7703, '<td valign="top">To much reflection.</td>', 'To much reflection.', '2006-04-29 09:06:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2356312, 324789, 7703, '<td valign="top">Why did you not shoot straight-on the frame?</td>', 'Why did you not shoot straight-on the frame?', '2006-04-29 09:06:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2356313, 323946, 7703, '<td valign="top">This photo makes me disee.</td>', 'This photo makes me disee.', '2006-04-29 09:07:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2356314, 324804, 56047, '<td valign="top">Really wonderful expression and mood that you captured in this little boy, which fits well with your title. However, I find the white background to be a little distracting, pulling my eyes off you main subject. Perhaps the original background was too busy, which is why you chose to remove it. The highlights on the hair and the arm also seem just a touch blown on my monitor.</td>', 'Really wonderful expression and mood that you captured in this little boy, which fits well with your title. However, I find the white background to be a little distracting, pulling my eyes off you main subject. Perhaps the original background was too busy, which is why you chose to remove it. The highlights on the hair and the arm also seem just a touch blown on my monitor.', '2006-04-29 09:07:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2356316, 324359, 7703, '<td valign="top">Ok something else than all the others, though not sure how I like it, would maybe want to see the whole frame in the photo.</td>', 'Ok something else than all the others, though not sure how I like it, would maybe want to see the whole frame in the photo.', '2006-04-29 09:08:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2356318, 324942, 7703, '<td valign="top">Why did you not crop all the sides of the frame so they would all be as wide.</td>', 'Why did you not crop all the sides of the frame so they would all be as wide.', '2006-04-29 09:09:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2356321, 323551, 7703, '<td valign="top">Another photo that I think needs more frame ... show the whole window.</td>', 'Another photo that I think needs more frame ... show the whole window.', '2006-04-29 09:09:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2356324, 324312, 7703, '<td valign="top">Is this a window? Why do you use this blue border? It does not look good.</td>', 'Is this a window? Why do you use this blue border? It does not look good.', '2006-04-29 09:10:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2356325, 324425, 56047, '<td valign="top">Good focus, lighting and color. The gun in the photo raises a lot of questions about the scene, and raises the visual interest in this photo, although I sort of wish there were some more visual cues as to why she is holding that gun, which I think would help complete the story...</td>', 'Good focus, lighting and color. The gun in the photo raises a lot of questions about the scene, and raises the visual interest in this photo, although I sort of wish there were some more visual cues as to why she is holding that gun, which I think would help complete the story...', '2006-04-29 09:11:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2356326, 324968, 7703, '<td valign="top">Maybe to dark but I like it if we don''t think about that. So next time litle lighter and maybe add some sepia effect?</td>', 'Maybe to dark but I like it if we don''t think about that. So next time litle lighter and maybe add some sepia effect?', '2006-04-29 09:11:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2356330, 322264, 7703, '<td valign="top">Needs more frameing from a window. Also I would have liked to see the whole frame. The frame also cuts of the tree and that I don''t like.</td>', 'Needs more frameing from a window. Also I would have liked to see the whole frame. The frame also cuts of the tree and that I don''t like.', '2006-04-29 09:12:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2356331, 322777, 7703, '<td valign="top">Looks great and the border around the photot also adds a litle bit to it. Good colors.</td>', 'Looks great and the border around the photot also adds a litle bit to it. Good colors.', '2006-04-29 09:13:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2356332, 324657, 7703, '<td valign="top">Finaly photo that I like. Good idea. Lightning good but one thing that distracts me is this white thing in front of the guy (maybe his other hand).</td>', 'Finaly photo that I like. Good idea. Lightning good but one thing that distracts me is this white thing in front of the guy (maybe his other hand).', '2006-04-29 09:15:09.000000', NULL, 1),
