(2356516, 325078, 8522, '<td valign="top">Nice effect, but the corners of the photo aren''t particularly inspired. With some more vivid colours and more interesting subject matter this effect could look great.</td>', 'Nice effect, but the corners of the photo aren''t particularly inspired. With some more vivid colours and more interesting subject matter this effect could look great.', '2006-04-29 10:02:09.000000', NULL, 1),
