(2356519, 324139, 8522, '<td valign="top">Beautiful! Bokeh looks very artifical though. Love the flowers at the top. Don''t like the tobacco yellow tone to the photo.</td>', 'Beautiful! Bokeh looks very artifical though. Love the flowers at the top. Don''t like the tobacco yellow tone to the photo.', '2006-04-29 10:04:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2356521, 325068, 8522, '<td valign="top">Not really a fan of the view out of this window. Symmetry can be an unimaginative way to compose a photo and it hasn''t worked here, especially as the window is not straight on. Quality of light isn''t amazing and the sky isn''t particularly interesting.</td>', 'Not really a fan of the view out of this window. Symmetry can be an unimaginative way to compose a photo and it hasn''t worked here, especially as the window is not straight on. Quality of light isn''t amazing and the sky isn''t particularly interesting.', '2006-04-29 10:05:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2356522, 323946, 8522, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea, but really needs an extra element to add more complexity. The bokeh of the bricks in the background looks good.</td>', 'Interesting idea, but really needs an extra element to add more complexity. The bokeh of the bricks in the background looks good.', '2006-04-29 10:07:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2356524, 322536, 8522, '<td valign="top">Would be a lovely view if I was there, but this photo doesn''t make it ''pop''. Sky looks a little washed out. Trees don''t make for a really great composition.</td>', 'Would be a lovely view if I was there, but this photo doesn''t make it ''pop''. Sky looks a little washed out. Trees don''t make for a really great composition.', '2006-04-29 10:08:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2356530, 325094, 8522, '<td valign="top">Wonderful colours, particularly the inside walls. I''d have crouched or raised myself on tiptoes to place the building on the left (Empire State?) better. The silhouettes could be more effective... perhaps a couple in profile?</td>', 'Wonderful colours, particularly the inside walls. I''d have crouched or raised myself on tiptoes to place the building on the left (Empire State?) better. The silhouettes could be more effective... perhaps a couple in profile?', '2006-04-29 10:09:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2356532, 325079, 8522, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea, but the tree on the right spoils the effect. More clouds and a darker sky would have made it more effective.</td>', 'Interesting idea, but the tree on the right spoils the effect. More clouds and a darker sky would have made it more effective.', '2006-04-29 10:10:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2356537, 324103, 8522, '<td valign="top">Shots of side-mirrors always feel like a cop-out to me and are the hallmark of the beginner photographer. It communicates that the photographer couldn''t be bothered to get out and take a really good photo. Nice sky though.</td>', 'Shots of side-mirrors always feel like a cop-out to me and are the hallmark of the beginner photographer. It communicates that the photographer couldn''t be bothered to get out and take a really good photo. Nice sky though.', '2006-04-29 10:12:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2356544, 324789, 8522, '<td valign="top">I love the deep, rich blue but the centred composition doesn''t do it for me I''m afraid. Shame about the reflections in the window, a polariser might have fixed those.</td>', 'I love the deep, rich blue but the centred composition doesn''t do it for me I''m afraid. Shame about the reflections in the window, a polariser might have fixed those.', '2006-04-29 10:13:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2356549, 324858, 8522, '<td valign="top">Although it is good when a photo tells a story, there aren''t enough cues here for me to be interested in why he''s trying to get in or why he''s locked out.</td>', 'Although it is good when a photo tells a story, there aren''t enough cues here for me to be interested in why he''s trying to get in or why he''s locked out.', '2006-04-29 10:14:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2356554, 324893, 8522, '<td valign="top">Wow, great composition, but the grungy texture on the man''s face is way too strong and unsubtle. Shame, as it''s a strong photo otherwise.</td>', 'Wow, great composition, but the grungy texture on the man''s face is way too strong and unsubtle. Shame, as it''s a strong photo otherwise.', '2006-04-29 10:15:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2356567, 323053, 8522, '<td valign="top">Could be a very strong composition, but I''m not convinced by your model, whose expression is a little bland here. I''d have perhaps burnt in your outside wall a tad to focus attention inside the window. The focus appears to be on the outside wall and not on the subject.</td>', 'Could be a very strong composition, but I''m not convinced by your model, whose expression is a little bland here. I''d have perhaps burnt in your outside wall a tad to focus attention inside the window. The focus appears to be on the outside wall and not on the subject.', '2006-04-29 10:18:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2356571, 323897, 8522, '<td valign="top">Some interesting colours and shapes, but I''m left wondering why I''m looking at a photo of a bra.</td>', 'Some interesting colours and shapes, but I''m left wondering why I''m looking at a photo of a bra.', '2006-04-29 10:19:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2356579, 324548, 8522, '<td valign="top">A nice effect that isn''t helped by an uninspiring exterior. I''d have brought the camera down to the dog''s level rather than looking down... it looks unimaginative as if you''ve just brought the camera to your eye at normal standing height.</td>', 'A nice effect that isn''t helped by an uninspiring exterior. I''d have brought the camera down to the dog''s level rather than looking down... it looks unimaginative as if you''ve just brought the camera to your eye at normal standing height.', '2006-04-29 10:20:29.000000', NULL, 1),
