(2356619, 324730, 8522, '<td valign="top">A captivating shot, but it''s difficult to work out quite what we''re looking at.</td>', 'A captivating shot, but it''s difficult to work out quite what we''re looking at.', '2006-04-29 10:27:33.000000', NULL, 1),
