(2357377, 324567, 40679, '<td valign="top">at a first view, I didn''t really like this, so I gave you a low score. right now I like the way your photo is set up. the window frame looks like steps and the sharpness is actually allright. bumping up!</td>', 'at a first view, I didn''t really like this, so I gave you a low score. right now I like the way your photo is set up. the window frame looks like steps and the sharpness is actually allright. bumping up!', '2006-04-29 13:26:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2357380, 324589, 40679, '<td valign="top">I can understand the choice you''ve made for the compo, but this photo isn''t really appealing to me.</td>', 'I can understand the choice you''ve made for the compo, but this photo isn''t really appealing to me.', '2006-04-29 13:26:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2357383, 324792, 32854, '<td valign="top">The harsh white lines truly create a sense of separation. Nice job.</td>', 'The harsh white lines truly create a sense of separation. Nice job.', '2006-04-29 13:27:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2357384, 323533, 52074, '<td valign="top">Just got back from Fla. the day this challenge was due, and all I thought about was the 3 old window frames like this one that I had sitting in my gararge.  Didn''t have time to make it happen, but glad someone did...and did a damned good job of it at that!  One of my fav''s!! Great job!! "10" from me.</td>', 'Just got back from Fla. the day this challenge was due, and all I thought about was the 3 old window frames like this one that I had sitting in my gararge.  Didn''t have time to make it happen, but glad someone did...and did a damned good job of it at that!  One of my fav''s!! Great job!! "10" from me.', '2006-04-29 13:27:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2357385, 325017, 40679, '<td valign="top">I know this is nothing you can do about it anymore, but I think she''s posing / smiling for you too obvious. I also think NI is a bit too much.</td>', 'I know this is nothing you can do about it anymore, but I think she''s posing / smiling for you too obvious. I also think NI is a bit too much.', '2006-04-29 13:27:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2357387, 324875, 43298, '<td valign="top">Nice vibrant colours...</td>', 'Nice vibrant colours...', '2006-04-29 13:27:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2357395, 325083, 52074, '<td valign="top">Good idea here, but it took me too long to find him. The brightness of the greenery mixed with the darkness of the stone and shadows are too overwhelming to really take notice to the main subject for me.</td>', 'Good idea here, but it took me too long to find him. The brightness of the greenery mixed with the darkness of the stone and shadows are too overwhelming to really take notice to the main subject for me.', '2006-04-29 13:29:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2357397, 322264, 40679, '<td valign="top">why didn''t you crop the photo so you could only see the actual window? the fence and the foreground doesn''t really add something to the photo IMO, and without it I think it would be a bit more interesting, also if you make the colors a bit more sparkling</td>', 'why didn''t you crop the photo so you could only see the actual window? the fence and the foreground doesn''t really add something to the photo IMO, and without it I think it would be a bit more interesting, also if you make the colors a bit more sparkling', '2006-04-29 13:29:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2357399, 324714, 32854, '<td valign="top">Interesting perspective.</td>', 'Interesting perspective.', '2006-04-29 13:29:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2357418, 324445, 43298, '<td valign="top">This picture might have been better if you just had the man in the window in the frame rather than the distracting things around the outside of it...good idea though, and good subject.</td>', 'This picture might have been better if you just had the man in the window in the frame rather than the distracting things around the outside of it...good idea though, and good subject.', '2006-04-29 13:32:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2357420, 323148, 52074, '<td valign="top">I''m a knockover for old country, middle-of-nowhere concept photo''s and this one pulled me in.  Love the one window effect, the old abondoned structure in the background.  The contrast of the greenery with the rust, mixed in with the blues of the sky really pull together to form a nice view for me.It might be just a little over-saturated, but that is just IMHO. 8</td>', 'I''m a knockover for old country, middle-of-nowhere concept photo''s and this one pulled me in.  Love the one window effect, the old abondoned structure in the background.  The contrast of the greenery with the rust, mixed in with the blues of the sky really pull together to form a nice view for me.It might be just a little over-saturated, but that is just IMHO. 8', '2006-04-29 13:32:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2357427, 323718, 32854, '<td valign="top">Very well done. You have a good composition and an appealing subject.</td>', 'Very well done. You have a good composition and an appealing subject.', '2006-04-29 13:34:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2357430, 324816, 52074, '<td valign="top">I really like the old window, the chipped "it''s-been-painted-23-times" look, the crop and shape of it, but the kids cut-out being white, takes away from that rustic feel I got when I first came upon it.</td>', 'I really like the old window, the chipped "it''s-been-painted-23-times" look, the crop and shape of it, but the kids cut-out being white, takes away from that rustic feel I got when I first came upon it.', '2006-04-29 13:34:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2357432, 324196, 10390, '<td valign="top">An ok idea, but I find the blinds distract more than help the photo, nice try though</td>', 'An ok idea, but I find the blinds distract more than help the photo, nice try though', '2006-04-29 13:35:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2357453, 324972, 10390, '<td valign="top">Very nice colors... I like this one, is this taken through a window?</td>', 'Very nice colors... I like this one, is this taken through a window?', '2006-04-29 13:37:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2357466, 323364, 10390, '<td valign="top">good street photography.. a bit too centered maybe</td>', 'good street photography.. a bit too centered maybe', '2006-04-29 13:38:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2357469, 325054, 52074, '<td valign="top">Damned sweet!!! "10"  The various shades of white, eggshell, antiqueness vs. the newness, the blending and fades thruout.....This has got to be a ribbon winner!! I''d kill to shoot something like this!! I''d frame it and put it in my house today....even tho I don''t know her!!! Excellent job!!! Did I say "10" already?? I''d give it an "11" if it were available. Maybe I should contact the SC.  :O)</td>', 'Damned sweet!!! "10"  The various shades of white, eggshell, antiqueness vs. the newness, the blending and fades thruout.....This has got to be a ribbon winner!! I''d kill to shoot something like this!! I''d frame it and put it in my house today....even tho I don''t know her!!! Excellent job!!! Did I say "10" already?? I''d give it an "11" if it were available. Maybe I should contact the SC.  :O)', '2006-04-29 13:38:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2357476, 324876, 10390, '<td valign="top">this is creative, good approach to the challenge..</td>', 'this is creative, good approach to the challenge..', '2006-04-29 13:39:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2357478, 324397, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nice choice for this challenge and the saturation of the colors, especially the blue, is very pleasing in this shot.</td>', 'Nice choice for this challenge and the saturation of the colors, especially the blue, is very pleasing in this shot.', '2006-04-29 13:39:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2357484, 324312, 10390, '<td valign="top">This doesn''t seem to be exatly "window framed", nice photo though..</td>', 'This doesn''t seem to be exatly "window framed", nice photo though..', '2006-04-29 13:40:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2357496, 323686, 10390, '<td valign="top">Great contrast and colors, it would be much better if the people''s heads wouldn''t be "cut off". Great idea...</td>', 'Great contrast and colors, it would be much better if the people''s heads wouldn''t be "cut off". Great idea...', '2006-04-29 13:41:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2357505, 324647, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nice idea!  Wonder if there was a way you could have captured it such that the lighthouse reflection covered both panes.</td>', 'Nice idea!  Wonder if there was a way you could have captured it such that the lighthouse reflection covered both panes.', '2006-04-29 13:43:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2357516, 324511, 36065, '<td valign="top">The toning and subject in this one sets a terrific, rainy-type mood.  I think that the large pain is a bit disctracting, and shifting your position to the left a bit would have improve the composition.  Perhaps cropping the single pane where the 4 psople are standing.</td>', 'The toning and subject in this one sets a terrific, rainy-type mood.  I think that the large pain is a bit disctracting, and shifting your position to the left a bit would have improve the composition.  Perhaps cropping the single pane where the 4 psople are standing.', '2006-04-29 13:44:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2357517, 324893, 10390, '<td valign="top">A different approach to the challenge, but not exatly as I understand the challenge details. Good photo, well framed.</td>', 'A different approach to the challenge, but not exatly as I understand the challenge details. Good photo, well framed.', '2006-04-29 13:44:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2357520, 324641, 10390, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, the curtains add a nice framing...</td>', 'Nice photo, the curtains add a nice framing...', '2006-04-29 13:45:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2357528, 325040, 36065, '<td valign="top">I like the angled composition and the warm tone this capture has.  I might have straightened it about a degree and a hlf clockwise, but that would be about it.  Nice capture.</td>', 'I like the angled composition and the warm tone this capture has.  I might have straightened it about a degree and a hlf clockwise, but that would be about it.  Nice capture.', '2006-04-29 13:46:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2357529, 324959, 10390, '<td valign="top">Good photo, but it doesn''t fit the theme for me, this isn''t window framed.</td>', 'Good photo, but it doesn''t fit the theme for me, this isn''t window framed.', '2006-04-29 13:46:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2357538, 324141, 36065, '<td valign="top">The grame in this window is overbearing and really steals from the composition.  Nice lighting, exposure and crisp focus, but perhaps a different window would have been nicer.</td>', 'The grame in this window is overbearing and really steals from the composition.  Nice lighting, exposure and crisp focus, but perhaps a different window would have been nicer.', '2006-04-29 13:47:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2357542, 324789, 30982, '<td valign="top">Immediately grabs your attention - very striking and well seen.</td>', 'Immediately grabs your attention - very striking and well seen.', '2006-04-29 13:47:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2357546, 324812, 10390, '<td valign="top">the pp seems different between the windows, should be the same... the subject framed isn''t interesting enough.. better luck next time...</td>', 'the pp seems different between the windows, should be the same... the subject framed isn''t interesting enough.. better luck next time...', '2006-04-29 13:48:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2357550, 325137, 30982, '<td valign="top">Great choice of window, well exposed, great colors.  Only thing that is a bit odd to me is why she''d be wearing that dress in the middle of nowhere.</td>', 'Great choice of window, well exposed, great colors.  Only thing that is a bit odd to me is why she''d be wearing that dress in the middle of nowhere.', '2006-04-29 13:48:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2357554, 324430, 36065, '<td valign="top">This one has the WOW factor.  Excellent composition and image tone that produces a longing mood.  The top left corner is blown out and a little distracting, but that''s about the only criticism.  Great capture.</td>', 'This one has the WOW factor.  Excellent composition and image tone that produces a longing mood.  The top left corner is blown out and a little distracting, but that''s about the only criticism.  Great capture.', '2006-04-29 13:49:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2357557, 325062, 30982, '<td valign="top">Interesting juxtaposition!</td>', 'Interesting juxtaposition!', '2006-04-29 13:49:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2357558, 324890, 10390, '<td valign="top">this image seems to be oversharpened, very nice windows there but the subject isn''t very interesting...</td>', 'this image seems to be oversharpened, very nice windows there but the subject isn''t very interesting...', '2006-04-29 13:49:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2357566, 324312, 36065, '<td valign="top">I think that a closer position and a tighter crop would have helped this one out a great deal.  I do not see the window framing in the shot.</td>', 'I think that a closer position and a tighter crop would have helped this one out a great deal.  I do not see the window framing in the shot.', '2006-04-29 13:50:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2357570, 323551, 10390, '<td valign="top">Good idea but I think if the boy would have looked to the left (his right) it would be better..</td>', 'Good idea but I think if the boy would have looked to the left (his right) it would be better..', '2006-04-29 13:51:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2357573, 324642, 36065, '<td valign="top">While not a bad idea, I thnk this one is more window-lit than window framed.  I like his expression and the grainy feel to the image.  I''d like to see the rest of that left foot, as chopping it off leads the viewer''s eyes right out of the frame.</td>', 'While not a bad idea, I thnk this one is more window-lit than window framed.  I like his expression and the grainy feel to the image.  I''d like to see the rest of that left foot, as chopping it off leads the viewer''s eyes right out of the frame.', '2006-04-29 13:52:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2357584, 325102, 36065, '<td valign="top">Really nice toning treatment and composition.  I think that I might have tried shooting throught he window on her left as the bell and white structure in the foreground are distracting.  Very well done with the selective BW, though.</td>', 'Really nice toning treatment and composition.  I think that I might have tried shooting throught he window on her left as the bell and white structure in the foreground are distracting.  Very well done with the selective BW, though.', '2006-04-29 13:53:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2357587, 324139, 10390, '<td valign="top">nice one, but I tried to scroll to see the top of the photo.. then I noticed that this is it... this is good but would be better if the window frame would also be at the top... I imagine that it wasn''t possible..</td>', 'nice one, but I tried to scroll to see the top of the photo.. then I noticed that this is it... this is good but would be better if the window frame would also be at the top... I imagine that it wasn''t possible..', '2006-04-29 13:54:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2357597, 324639, 10390, '<td valign="top">looks like a pretty old photo... it would have been better if the kids would have been closer to each other..</td>', 'looks like a pretty old photo... it would have been better if the kids would have been closer to each other..', '2006-04-29 13:55:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2357601, 324110, 36065, '<td valign="top">I like this one, but I would like to have seen a little tighter crop.  Perhaps pulling about 1/5th off the right and 1/10th off the bottom, thus getting the fram closer to the lower left corner.  Nice toning and crisp focus, and nice exposure overall with all the various elements.</td>', 'I like this one, but I would like to have seen a little tighter crop.  Perhaps pulling about 1/5th off the right and 1/10th off the bottom, thus getting the fram closer to the lower left corner.  Nice toning and crisp focus, and nice exposure overall with all the various elements.', '2006-04-29 13:56:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2357602, 324445, 10390, '<td valign="top">This is pretty good, a good catch there and great idea</td>', 'This is pretty good, a good catch there and great idea', '2006-04-29 13:56:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2357609, 325077, 10390, '<td valign="top">there is just too much "going on" in this picture, it lacks the point of interest..</td>', 'there is just too much "going on" in this picture, it lacks the point of interest..', '2006-04-29 13:57:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2357613, 322777, 36065, '<td valign="top">I think that this is a nice idea, but it just comes across too busy.  Maybe raising the window lace up just a bit and cropping tighter would reduce some of the jumble.  Nice focus and exposure.</td>', 'I think that this is a nice idea, but it just comes across too busy.  Maybe raising the window lace up just a bit and cropping tighter would reduce some of the jumble.  Nice focus and exposure.', '2006-04-29 13:57:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2357619, 325094, 10390, '<td valign="top">Great light and good photo, it seems to be oversharpened..</td>', 'Great light and good photo, it seems to be oversharpened..', '2006-04-29 13:58:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2357629, 325086, 36065, '<td valign="top">I like this composition, and the focus is crisp.  I thnk shift your position a bit would remove that brown house reflection and make this shot even better.  The grass reflects nicely, but the house draws too much attention.  Nice shot overall.</td>', 'I like this composition, and the focus is crisp.  I thnk shift your position a bit would remove that brown house reflection and make this shot even better.  The grass reflects nicely, but the house draws too much attention.  Nice shot overall.', '2006-04-29 13:59:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2357634, 324873, 10390, '<td valign="top">good idea but not very interesting photo... the concrete wall to the right distracts.. a vertical framed photo of the center would have been better..</td>', 'good idea but not very interesting photo... the concrete wall to the right distracts.. a vertical framed photo of the center would have been better..', '2006-04-29 13:59:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2357638, 323746, 10390, '<td valign="top">This is pretty good, nice colors but seems to be overexposed a little, it lacks details on the wall</td>', 'This is pretty good, nice colors but seems to be overexposed a little, it lacks details on the wall', '2006-04-29 14:00:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2357639, 325120, 36065, '<td valign="top">Neat idea, and great exposure.  I think a tighter crop would have made this one better, getting rid of most of the top and most of the right hand side.  Very well focused on the subject.</td>', 'Neat idea, and great exposure.  I think a tighter crop would have made this one better, getting rid of most of the top and most of the right hand side.  Very well focused on the subject.', '2006-04-29 14:00:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2357643, 325100, 10390, '<td valign="top">the mirrored car there distracts, but otherwise this is pretty good..</td>', 'the mirrored car there distracts, but otherwise this is pretty good..', '2006-04-29 14:01:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2357645, 325114, 10390, '<td valign="top">the main point of interest in this photo isn''t window framed, for me it should be... there are windows there and a lot to work with..</td>', 'the main point of interest in this photo isn''t window framed, for me it should be... there are windows there and a lot to work with..', '2006-04-29 14:02:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2357646, 325100, 36065, '<td valign="top">I like this capture, but I think that the vehicle reflecting draws too much attention.  I also feel that the focus is more on the tree reflection at the top than the little girl.  Nice toning and mood, but I think I would have moved the van.  But, its not always easy to re-do toddler shots, is it?</td>', 'I like this capture, but I think that the vehicle reflecting draws too much attention.  I also feel that the focus is more on the tree reflection at the top than the little girl.  Nice toning and mood, but I think I would have moved the van.  But, its not always easy to re-do toddler shots, is it?', '2006-04-29 14:02:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2357649, 324359, 10390, '<td valign="top">This is very good, I like it, well done with the framing</td>', 'This is very good, I like it, well done with the framing', '2006-04-29 14:03:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2357657, 324435, 10390, '<td valign="top">an ok street photography but it is too dark, should be brighter..</td>', 'an ok street photography but it is too dark, should be brighter..', '2006-04-29 14:04:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2357659, 324856, 36065, '<td valign="top">Okay, whose diriving?!?  This was one of the most creative shots of the challenge.  I like the composition and the exposure looks perfect.  I think that I would have opened up that aperature to get a more shallow depth of field to blur the ground a bit.  Overall, very nice.</td>', 'Okay, whose diriving?!?  This was one of the most creative shots of the challenge.  I like the composition and the exposure looks perfect.  I think that I would have opened up that aperature to get a more shallow depth of field to blur the ground a bit.  Overall, very nice.', '2006-04-29 14:04:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2357666, 324445, 36065, '<td valign="top">Getting outside that window from your position would have made this one much nicer.  I like the way the painter(?) has framed himself for you.  Good eye.</td>', 'Getting outside that window from your position would have made this one much nicer.  I like the way the painter(?) has framed himself for you.  Good eye.', '2006-04-29 14:05:24.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(2357673, 324072, 10390, '<td valign="top">the window there is interestin by itself, but it isn''t framing the point of interest like it should be... or maybe I''m wrong, maybe it is framing the broken glass... maybe it could have used a little bit longer exposure</td>', 'the window there is interestin by itself, but it isn''t framing the point of interest like it should be... or maybe I''m wrong, maybe it is framing the broken glass... maybe it could have used a little bit longer exposure', '2006-04-29 14:06:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2357677, 322130, 36065, '<td valign="top">Excellent arcitecture capture, but I am missing the window framed part.  The colors are terrific and the focus is nice.  The upper left portion of the building looks a little overexposed, but not enough to complain.  Did you add gradient fill to those windows?</td>', 'Excellent arcitecture capture, but I am missing the window framed part.  The colors are terrific and the focus is nice.  The upper left portion of the building looks a little overexposed, but not enough to complain.  Did you add gradient fill to those windows?', '2006-04-29 14:07:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2357680, 324946, 10390, '<td valign="top">Good photo, great focus and good window framing...</td>', 'Good photo, great focus and good window framing...', '2006-04-29 14:07:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2357687, 323053, 10390, '<td valign="top">Good photo, I  like it, but would be better with the person looking in the lens..</td>', 'Good photo, I  like it, but would be better with the person looking in the lens..', '2006-04-29 14:08:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2357691, 323551, 36065, '<td valign="top">Ah, the rain messes up plans.  Great mood conveyence with the color and expression.  Still a bit too centered for my taste, but a nice capture.  I think having him look the other side of the window would have improved the composition.  It feels like he is looking out of the frame.</td>', 'Ah, the rain messes up plans.  Great mood conveyence with the color and expression.  Still a bit too centered for my taste, but a nice capture.  I think having him look the other side of the window would have improved the composition.  It feels like he is looking out of the frame.', '2006-04-29 14:09:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2357694, 323467, 10390, '<td valign="top">Very good, I like how the window splits the view to three seperate images... well done..</td>', 'Very good, I like how the window splits the view to three seperate images... well done..', '2006-04-29 14:09:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2357699, 324667, 10390, '<td valign="top">the subject there isn''t interesting enough and is too centered..</td>', 'the subject there isn''t interesting enough and is too centered..', '2006-04-29 14:10:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2357700, 325071, 36065, '<td valign="top">Nice capture, but the focus seems to be on the wood of the window instead of the little boy.  The centered composotion works for this one, but I''d straighten the tilt a bit.</td>', 'Nice capture, but the focus seems to be on the wood of the window instead of the little boy.  The centered composotion works for this one, but I''d straighten the tilt a bit.', '2006-04-29 14:10:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2357709, 323533, 10390, '<td valign="top">Great idea and well done... maybe you should have put the tree in the window frame, you probably tried it..?</td>', 'Great idea and well done... maybe you should have put the tree in the window frame, you probably tried it..?', '2006-04-29 14:12:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2357711, 324748, 58085, '<td valign="top">This picture is absolutely gorgeous.  The name works...old suggests abandonment and the scenery around is desolate and lonley.  Great work!</td>', 'This picture is absolutely gorgeous.  The name works...old suggests abandonment and the scenery around is desolate and lonley.  Great work!', '2006-04-29 14:13:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2357714, 323804, 36065, '<td valign="top">I reallt, really like the toning and the framing here, but the composition is too busy.  I can understand why you wanted to keep it all in, as it is a terrific building for photographing.  I think a tighter crop would have improved this one a great deal.  Maybe including the arch, but loosing the botom of the shot to leave the open window and panties in the lower left corner woudl work better.</td>', 'I reallt, really like the toning and the framing here, but the composition is too busy.  I can understand why you wanted to keep it all in, as it is a terrific building for photographing.  I think a tighter crop would have improved this one a great deal.  Maybe including the arch, but loosing the botom of the shot to leave the open window and panties in the lower left corner woudl work better.', '2006-04-29 14:13:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2357719, 324616, 36065, '<td valign="top">I think you picked a perfect window for framing, but there is really no subject other than the window itself.  Nice focus and good exposure, but I think that there needs to be something other than the distant tree in the frame.</td>', 'I think you picked a perfect window for framing, but there is really no subject other than the window itself.  Nice focus and good exposure, but I think that there needs to be something other than the distant tree in the frame.', '2006-04-29 14:15:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2357726, 325075, 36065, '<td valign="top">Well-done.  I like the way the screen provides a captured feel to the image.  I think that I may have shifted my position a bit to get the barn more out of the center, but nice capture overall.  The tulips lead my eye trough the shot and to the barn very well, then the barn up to the sky.  Good eye.</td>', 'Well-done.  I like the way the screen provides a captured feel to the image.  I think that I may have shifted my position a bit to get the barn more out of the center, but nice capture overall.  The tulips lead my eye trough the shot and to the barn very well, then the barn up to the sky.  Good eye.', '2006-04-29 14:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2357727, 323806, 10390, '<td valign="top">great idea, but the angle of view doesn''t make this realistic enough facing downwards as it is.. I like the idea and the lighting mood..</td>', 'great idea, but the angle of view doesn''t make this realistic enough facing downwards as it is.. I like the idea and the lighting mood..', '2006-04-29 14:17:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2357734, 324649, 47852, '<td valign="top">A bit too busy for me.  Theres seems to be too many shapes and colors that it''s hard to find a focal point.</td>', 'A bit too busy for me.  Theres seems to be too many shapes and colors that it''s hard to find a focal point.', '2006-04-29 14:18:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2357735, 324993, 36065, '<td valign="top">Great idea, but the couple is a little too centered.  I like the way your lighting makes the almost jump out of the frame.  Great expressions, and beautiful flexibility. ;)</td>', 'Great idea, but the couple is a little too centered.  I like the way your lighting makes the almost jump out of the frame.  Great expressions, and beautiful flexibility. ;)', '2006-04-29 14:18:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2357740, 324103, 36065, '<td valign="top">These are always some of my favorite shots, as I have taken way too many of them.  However, this really doesn''t give me a feeling of looking through a window at a subject.  The composition and exposure are near flawless, but it really doesn''t meet the challenge in my opinion.</td>', 'These are always some of my favorite shots, as I have taken way too many of them.  However, this really doesn''t give me a feeling of looking through a window at a subject.  The composition and exposure are near flawless, but it really doesn''t meet the challenge in my opinion.', '2006-04-29 14:19:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2357750, 325136, 36065, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed and captured.  The tonal range is nicely covered and the crutain really leads the eye around the frame.  Nicely seen.</td>', 'Nicely composed and captured.  The tonal range is nicely covered and the crutain really leads the eye around the frame.  Nicely seen.', '2006-04-29 14:20:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2357760, 323522, 47852, '<td valign="top">I think a quick levels adjustment would help this shot by getting rid of the hazy look, otherwise a nice shot.</td>', 'I think a quick levels adjustment would help this shot by getting rid of the hazy look, otherwise a nice shot.', '2006-04-29 14:22:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2357762, 324421, 36065, '<td valign="top">Your focus and exposure are near flawless, but I get a more window-lit feeling to this one than a window-framed.  Perhaps cropping tighter on the man and getting him out of the center of the fram would have improved it for this particular challenge.  All of the elements fit with each other very well, just not for this challenge.</td>', 'Your focus and exposure are near flawless, but I get a more window-lit feeling to this one than a window-framed.  Perhaps cropping tighter on the man and getting him out of the center of the fram would have improved it for this particular challenge.  All of the elements fit with each other very well, just not for this challenge.', '2006-04-29 14:23:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2357770, 324614, 36065, '<td valign="top">I like the coloring and the depth of field you achieved with this shot.  I think backing up a bit and getting more of the window frame itself owuld have improved this one.  Good eye.</td>', 'I like the coloring and the depth of field you achieved with this shot.  I think backing up a bit and getting more of the window frame itself owuld have improved this one.  Good eye.', '2006-04-29 14:24:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2357779, 322536, 36065, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, and this one has lots of potential.  First of all, keep the image as large as possible dimension-wise when posting it.    I think a shift in your position to get more of the snow-capped mountains woudl have been a great improvement.  I am positive that I want to live there.</td>', 'Nice idea, and this one has lots of potential.  First of all, keep the image as large as possible dimension-wise when posting it.    I think a shift in your position to get more of the snow-capped mountains woudl have been a great improvement.  I am positive that I want to live there.', '2006-04-29 14:25:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2357786, 323364, 36065, '<td valign="top">My first consideration was that this is more of a reflection than a frame.  Looking closer, I see that it is both.  I think that I would have cropped her a little differently to get her out of the center, but nice capture overall.</td>', 'My first consideration was that this is more of a reflection than a frame.  Looking closer, I see that it is both.  I think that I would have cropped her a little differently to get her out of the center, but nice capture overall.', '2006-04-29 14:27:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2357796, 324268, 36065, '<td valign="top">I like the idea you hade here, but I think that he bright white circle is far too distracting.  Composing a little differently and exposing a little longer would have made this one a contender.  Great detail with the dirty window and nice focus.</td>', 'I like the idea you hade here, but I think that he bright white circle is far too distracting.  Composing a little differently and exposing a little longer would have made this one a contender.  Great detail with the dirty window and nice focus.', '2006-04-29 14:29:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2357803, 325017, 36065, '<td valign="top">Great lighting and a very nice smile.  I would have cropped a bit tighter to get the driver out of the frame and also would have thrown that poodle out the window.  (No, I don''t really hurt animals)  The colors all play together very well in this image.</td>', 'Great lighting and a very nice smile.  I would have cropped a bit tighter to get the driver out of the frame and also would have thrown that poodle out the window.  (No, I don''t really hurt animals)  The colors all play together very well in this image.', '2006-04-29 14:31:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2357805, 325046, 56735, '<td valign="top">A great photograph! Dramatic and soothing...comfort for my tired eyes...thats your family? <br/> <br/> You have great talent, my dear friend, great talent, within you.<br/> <br/>9/10 from me<br/> <br/>Soham</td>', 'A great photograph! Dramatic and soothing...comfort for my tired eyes...thats your family?   You have great talent, my dear friend, great talent, within you. 9/10 from me Soham', '2006-04-29 14:31:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2357806, 324885, 36065, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  I might have composed just a bit differently to include the rest of the basket handle, but that would be about the only change that I''d make.  Great colors and crisp focus.</td>', 'Very nice.  I might have composed just a bit differently to include the rest of the basket handle, but that would be about the only change that I''d make.  Great colors and crisp focus.', '2006-04-29 14:32:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2357810, 325013, 47852, '<td valign="top">Love the intricate patterns around the window.  Glad you didn''t center the window and the flags.. that might have been too static.</td>', 'Love the intricate patterns around the window.  Glad you didn''t center the window and the flags.. that might have been too static.', '2006-04-29 14:32:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2357811, 323551, 47852, '<td valign="top">Love the expression and the tilted hat.  Looks like you had a very patient model.  Nicely done!</td>', 'Love the expression and the tilted hat.  Looks like you had a very patient model.  Nicely done!', '2006-04-29 14:32:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2357812, 325090, 47852, '<td valign="top">Great colors here!  I like the silhouette, but wish the profile of her face wasn''t blended into the dark divider of the window.</td>', 'Great colors here!  I like the silhouette, but wish the profile of her face wasn''t blended into the dark divider of the window.', '2006-04-29 14:33:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2357841, 324712, 56735, '<td valign="top">This is Humayun''s tomb, if i am not wrong? Or another Mughal architecture? A great image, you have taken, pal, a great one. Best of luck, to you, boss! Just carry on clicking!! <br/> <br/> However, would not the pic been better, had u darkened the mosque a bit, which, undoubtedly, would have suppressed some interesting details, but would have added more drama to the pic. This is a digital photography contest, and hence, please go to photoshop and increase the contrast a bit, and then, place the two pics side by side, and observe the difference.<br/> <br/>8/10 from me <br/> <br/>Soham</td>', 'This is Humayun''s tomb, if i am not wrong? Or another Mughal architecture? A great image, you have taken, pal, a great one. Best of luck, to you, boss! Just carry on clicking!!   However, would not the pic been better, had u darkened the mosque a bit, which, undoubtedly, would have suppressed some interesting details, but would have added more drama to the pic. This is a digital photography contest, and hence, please go to photoshop and increase the contrast a bit, and then, place the two pics side by side, and observe the difference. 8/10 from me  Soham', '2006-04-29 14:37:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2357857, 324875, 56735, '<td valign="top">What is this? You definately got great talent in you, but we surely expect a better photograph, from the talented photographer, you are! <br/> <br/> Why don''t you pay more attention to composition?? This pic is very very boring, but surely exposes,the great talent u have in you.<br/> <br/> Best of luck and start hunting better subjects!<br/> <br/>Soham</td>', 'What is this? You definately got great talent in you, but we surely expect a better photograph, from the talented photographer, you are!   Why don''t you pay more attention to composition?? This pic is very very boring, but surely exposes,the great talent u have in you.  Best of luck and start hunting better subjects! Soham', '2006-04-29 14:39:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2357881, 324942, 56735, '<td valign="top">Great exposure, but bad composition! Why dont you all pay special emphasis on composition. Look at the pic! This pic shows that u have talent, but is not utilising it. Why a boring plant and not a playful child? Think think think, then make sketches in rough paper, and then, take the shot. Or better follow your instinct, be completely unprepared, and, suddenly, when u find good subjects,shoot ''em.<br/> <br/>Best of luck,<br/> <br/>Soham<br/> <br/>6-7/10</td>', 'Great exposure, but bad composition! Why dont you all pay special emphasis on composition. Look at the pic! This pic shows that u have talent, but is not utilising it. Why a boring plant and not a playful child? Think think think, then make sketches in rough paper, and then, take the shot. Or better follow your instinct, be completely unprepared, and, suddenly, when u find good subjects,shoot ''em. Best of luck, Soham 6-7/10', '2006-04-29 14:43:20.000000', NULL, 1),
