(2357904, 324196, 56735, '<td valign="top">Hats of to you, my dear friend. Great photo- great composition, great exposure and great framing-all essential elements, that must be present, in a great photographer.<br/> <br/> Interestingly, two great point of interest are the positions of two neon signs, one on top of the tallest building, and the other, on the top of the building to the extreme left. The position of the road sign also add more interest to the pic.<br/> <br/>Bravo! great job done.<br/> <br/>Best of luck and 10/10 from me,<br/> <br/>Soham</td>', 'Hats of to you, my dear friend. Great photo- great composition, great exposure and great framing-all essential elements, that must be present, in a great photographer.  Interestingly, two great point of interest are the positions of two neon signs, one on top of the tallest building, and the other, on the top of the building to the extreme left. The position of the road sign also add more interest to the pic. Bravo! great job done. Best of luck and 10/10 from me, Soham', '2006-04-29 14:47:11.000000', NULL, 1),
