(2358832, 325094, 15811, '<td valign="top">That looks like a really interesting scene...I bet somehow it could be a bit more interesting though, maybe a different angle or something.</td>', 'That looks like a really interesting scene...I bet somehow it could be a bit more interesting though, maybe a different angle or something.', '2006-04-29 17:28:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2358833, 325118, 33392, '<td valign="top">Unfortunate tattoo.  Took me a while to realize you were talking about the cigars.  The bright colors of the arm really grab your attention.</td>', 'Unfortunate tattoo.  Took me a while to realize you were talking about the cigars.  The bright colors of the arm really grab your attention.', '2006-04-29 17:28:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2358834, 323619, 15811, '<td valign="top">wow, I wish that was where I ate breakfast...what a nice view!</td>', 'wow, I wish that was where I ate breakfast...what a nice view!', '2006-04-29 17:28:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2358835, 324938, 15811, '<td valign="top">seems a bit overexposed throughout to me, although you got a nice view out of that window.</td>', 'seems a bit overexposed throughout to me, although you got a nice view out of that window.', '2006-04-29 17:28:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2358836, 324234, 33392, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.  I think I like this.  I think I would like to more if the universe were brighter and really contrasted with the blackness of the area outside of the frame.</td>', 'Nice idea.  I think I like this.  I think I would like to more if the universe were brighter and really contrasted with the blackness of the area outside of the frame.', '2006-04-29 17:29:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2358837, 324649, 15811, '<td valign="top">There''s really too much going on in this window...reflections, broken stuff, there''s just nowhere for the eye to really stop and come to a rest.</td>', 'There''s really too much going on in this window...reflections, broken stuff, there''s just nowhere for the eye to really stop and come to a rest.', '2006-04-29 17:29:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2358838, 325108, 15811, '<td valign="top">hrmm that''s crazy a window facing up</td>', 'hrmm that''s crazy a window facing up', '2006-04-29 17:30:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2358840, 323172, 15811, '<td valign="top">very nice scene there, but I think it''s overdone as far as post-processing goes.</td>', 'very nice scene there, but I think it''s overdone as far as post-processing goes.', '2006-04-29 17:30:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2358841, 324893, 15811, '<td valign="top">Nice angle.</td>', 'Nice angle.', '2006-04-29 17:30:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2358843, 324865, 15811, '<td valign="top">good idea, your composition is lacking and it''s a bit small for my taste.</td>', 'good idea, your composition is lacking and it''s a bit small for my taste.', '2006-04-29 17:31:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2358844, 324387, 33392, '<td valign="top">It''s never a good sign when you have to build in a defense of your definition into the title.....I will give you the benefit of the doubt anyhow.  <br/> <br/>The "window" is a bit dominating relative to the blues and greens of the subject.  I would love to see it in person some time.  Must be beautiful.</td>', 'It''s never a good sign when you have to build in a defense of your definition into the title.....I will give you the benefit of the doubt anyhow.   The "window" is a bit dominating relative to the blues and greens of the subject.  I would love to see it in person some time.  Must be beautiful.', '2006-04-29 17:31:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2358846, 322264, 33392, '<td valign="top">That''s not a window, but I don''t really care - beautiful and crisp!</td>', 'That''s not a window, but I don''t really care - beautiful and crisp!', '2006-04-29 17:31:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2358847, 324894, 15811, '<td valign="top">The image seems soft throughout and it looks like you have some mixed lighting here that varies greatly in color temperature...the blue from the natural light and the yellow from a tungsten...not that it''s a bad thing, just pointing that out if you didn''t know it.</td>', 'The image seems soft throughout and it looks like you have some mixed lighting here that varies greatly in color temperature...the blue from the natural light and the yellow from a tungsten...not that it''s a bad thing, just pointing that out if you didn''t know it.', '2006-04-29 17:32:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2358848, 324445, 33392, '<td valign="top">Wonderful colors, well composed, nice use of "grain".</td>', 'Wonderful colors, well composed, nice use of "grain".', '2006-04-29 17:32:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2358849, 323234, 33392, '<td valign="top">Damn power lines.  Nice composition and colors.</td>', 'Damn power lines.  Nice composition and colors.', '2006-04-29 17:32:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2358850, 324946, 15811, '<td valign="top">what a cute little kid heh...good work.</td>', 'what a cute little kid heh...good work.', '2006-04-29 17:32:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2358851, 324641, 33392, '<td valign="top">Looks so sad....  Nice colors and composition.</td>', 'Looks so sad....  Nice colors and composition.', '2006-04-29 17:32:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2358852, 325116, 15811, '<td valign="top">scary...can''t really see enough to say this''ll get a good score overall, but a select few probably really enjoy it.</td>', 'scary...can''t really see enough to say this''ll get a good score overall, but a select few probably really enjoy it.', '2006-04-29 17:33:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2358853, 324139, 25742, '<td valign="top">I like the quiet beauty of this moment.</td>', 'I like the quiet beauty of this moment.', '2006-04-29 17:33:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2358854, 324784, 33392, '<td valign="top">I really like this.  The colors, the shadows, the isolation of the person through one pane and the reflection of the mill in another.  Very well done.</td>', 'I really like this.  The colors, the shadows, the isolation of the person through one pane and the reflection of the mill in another.  Very well done.', '2006-04-29 17:33:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2358855, 324714, 15811, '<td valign="top">wow that''s crazy...did you take a window frame out with you or is that really where your window is?  That''s a beautiful scene...the best I''ve seen so far this challenge.  Good work.</td>', 'wow that''s crazy...did you take a window frame out with you or is that really where your window is?  That''s a beautiful scene...the best I''ve seen so far this challenge.  Good work.', '2006-04-29 17:34:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2358856, 325078, 33392, '<td valign="top">But where you???<br/> <br/>This really doesn''t work for me.</td>', 'But where you??? This really doesn''t work for me.', '2006-04-29 17:34:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2358857, 324972, 33392, '<td valign="top">What an odd frame.  I think the shallow DOF works for you here.</td>', 'What an odd frame.  I think the shallow DOF works for you here.', '2006-04-29 17:34:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2358859, 324589, 15811, '<td valign="top">interesting idea unfortunately the composition is probably lacking a little bit though...there''s just a lot going on in the photo.</td>', 'interesting idea unfortunately the composition is probably lacking a little bit though...there''s just a lot going on in the photo.', '2006-04-29 17:35:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2358860, 324107, 33392, '<td valign="top">The lighting feels very artificial.  The complete lack of shadows from the window, the bright blue background -</td>', 'The lighting feels very artificial.  The complete lack of shadows from the window, the bright blue background -', '2006-04-29 17:36:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2358861, 324445, 15811, '<td valign="top">That''s a neat shot and very interesting.  I like the coloring and the noise -- hopefully it''s being received well by the voters.</td>', 'That''s a neat shot and very interesting.  I like the coloring and the noise -- hopefully it''s being received well by the voters.', '2006-04-29 17:36:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2358862, 324812, 30982, '<td valign="top">The lighting and choice of window are very nice.  Not as sure about the choice of object, though.</td>', 'The lighting and choice of window are very nice.  Not as sure about the choice of object, though.', '2006-04-29 17:36:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2358863, 323708, 33392, '<td valign="top">It''s like something out of an old Life magazine.  Very nice.  Crisp, good use of b/w.  9</td>', 'It''s like something out of an old Life magazine.  Very nice.  Crisp, good use of b/w.  9', '2006-04-29 17:36:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2358864, 324784, 15811, '<td valign="top">wow nice capture here...this photo tells a story...love that you included what she''s looking at in the reflection.  Very well done.</td>', 'wow nice capture here...this photo tells a story...love that you included what she''s looking at in the reflection.  Very well done.', '2006-04-29 17:37:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2358865, 324616, 33392, '<td valign="top">Poor tree....</td>', 'Poor tree....', '2006-04-29 17:37:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2358869, 325068, 15811, '<td valign="top">Interesting scene -- your composition has everything centered though, which just doesn''t give the eye a nice flow throughout the image.</td>', 'Interesting scene -- your composition has everything centered though, which just doesn''t give the eye a nice flow throughout the image.', '2006-04-29 17:37:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2358870, 323718, 33392, '<td valign="top">One of the better reflection entries I have come across so far.</td>', 'One of the better reflection entries I have come across so far.', '2006-04-29 17:37:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2358872, 325015, 25742, '<td valign="top">strangely mismatched effects in different panes.<br/>kinda grows on you though.<br/>good luck</td>', 'strangely mismatched effects in different panes.kinda grows on you though.good luck', '2006-04-29 17:38:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2358875, 324703, 15811, '<td valign="top">pretty good idea, but your composition leaves a bit to be desired...just no main focal point or a nice flow throughout.</td>', 'pretty good idea, but your composition leaves a bit to be desired...just no main focal point or a nice flow throughout.', '2006-04-29 17:38:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2358876, 325095, 33392, '<td valign="top">Given the time exposure, I think I would''ve done it without the people.  Their slight blur from moving works against you.  Nice pastel colors though.</td>', 'Given the time exposure, I think I would''ve done it without the people.  Their slight blur from moving works against you.  Nice pastel colors though.', '2006-04-29 17:38:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2358880, 323619, 33392, '<td valign="top">I''m jealous - nice view indeed.  The red on the mountain almost seems like a volcano.</td>', 'I''m jealous - nice view indeed.  The red on the mountain almost seems like a volcano.', '2006-04-29 17:39:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2358881, 324177, 15811, '<td valign="top">that''s cute, good idea well-executed...the reflections hurt a good bit (I realize they''re part of what you''re trying to convey here though) -- have you tried using a polarizer to eliminate the reflections, I think the image would go from very good to great.  Good work though, I like it.</td>', 'that''s cute, good idea well-executed...the reflections hurt a good bit (I realize they''re part of what you''re trying to convey here though) -- have you tried using a polarizer to eliminate the reflections, I think the image would go from very good to great.  Good work though, I like it.', '2006-04-29 17:39:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2358884, 324579, 15811, '<td valign="top">lol...I hope you knew this guy...if not, you''re busted.</td>', 'lol...I hope you knew this guy...if not, you''re busted.', '2006-04-29 17:40:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2358885, 325062, 33392, '<td valign="top">This is a bit too sureal..</td>', 'This is a bit too sureal..', '2006-04-29 17:40:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2358887, 325069, 15811, '<td valign="top">good idea, but compositionally lacking...not really all that pleasing to look at to be honest.</td>', 'good idea, but compositionally lacking...not really all that pleasing to look at to be honest.', '2006-04-29 17:40:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2358890, 325138, 15811, '<td valign="top">nice idea, good shot, focus seems a bit soft though.</td>', 'nice idea, good shot, focus seems a bit soft though.', '2006-04-29 17:41:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2358891, 323477, 33392, '<td valign="top">I wish the angel were a bit more in focus.  Hard to accomplish through glass, but a polariser would help.</td>', 'I wish the angel were a bit more in focus.  Hard to accomplish through glass, but a polariser would help.', '2006-04-29 17:41:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2358892, 324072, 30982, '<td valign="top">Great choice of window frame and subject.  Lacking a bit of sharpness - well, not the glass - but in the picture itself.</td>', 'Great choice of window frame and subject.  Lacking a bit of sharpness - well, not the glass - but in the picture itself.', '2006-04-29 17:41:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2358893, 324139, 15811, '<td valign="top">That looks pretty neat, but something seems off...it looks like you blured what was outside or something.</td>', 'That looks pretty neat, but something seems off...it looks like you blured what was outside or something.', '2006-04-29 17:41:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2358898, 322985, 15811, '<td valign="top">Pretty overexposed ... it''s a tough lighting situation... This would be the perfect opportunity though to expose for outside light, and use some type of a reflector to get some light back onto your subject.</td>', 'Pretty overexposed ... it''s a tough lighting situation... This would be the perfect opportunity though to expose for outside light, and use some type of a reflector to get some light back onto your subject.', '2006-04-29 17:42:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2358901, 324815, 15811, '<td valign="top">You pretty much blocked everything with your window frame or the plants...think of your composition more while you''re out.</td>', 'You pretty much blocked everything with your window frame or the plants...think of your composition more while you''re out.', '2006-04-29 17:43:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2358902, 324984, 15811, '<td valign="top">cute shot with available light.</td>', 'cute shot with available light.', '2006-04-29 17:43:35.000000', NULL, 1),
