(2359823, 325120, 37858, '<td valign="top">This photo is a bit hard to follow.  There is so much blurring that I am a bit disoriented.  I assume this is a stained glass window, but I am not sure.  Other than that the picture is crisp, well-framed, and an overall creative effort.</td>', 'This photo is a bit hard to follow.  There is so much blurring that I am a bit disoriented.  I assume this is a stained glass window, but I am not sure.  Other than that the picture is crisp, well-framed, and an overall creative effort.', '2006-04-29 22:37:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2359828, 322985, 37858, '<td valign="top">I would try to tone down the background lighting a bit.  I think it overpowers a very attractive model.  I like the composition and "feel" of the photo.</td>', 'I would try to tone down the background lighting a bit.  I think it overpowers a very attractive model.  I like the composition and "feel" of the photo.', '2006-04-29 22:38:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2359836, 323477, 37858, '<td valign="top">This photo is a bit busy for my taste.  Other objects in the glass compete with the angel for attention.  Personally, I think that reflective pictures are difficult because lines appear fuzzy (I know, because I did the same kind of thing for this challenge with similar results).</td>', 'This photo is a bit busy for my taste.  Other objects in the glass compete with the angel for attention.  Personally, I think that reflective pictures are difficult because lines appear fuzzy (I know, because I did the same kind of thing for this challenge with similar results).', '2006-04-29 22:41:52.000000', NULL, 1),
