(2360051, 324902, 15811, '<td valign="top">hrmm not sure exactly what you were going for here...it looks as though you though "ok there''s a window with a window inside with a white wall, lemme take a picture of that...boom, snap done" ...<br/> <br/>Stop to think and compose and bring out what elements are really there -- something made you stop and take this photo...try and convey exactly what that is when you stop to take one.</td>', 'hrmm not sure exactly what you were going for here...it looks as though you though "ok there''s a window with a window inside with a white wall, lemme take a picture of that...boom, snap done" ... Stop to think and compose and bring out what elements are really there -- something made you stop and take this photo...try and convey exactly what that is when you stop to take one.', '2006-04-29 23:50:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2360053, 323718, 15811, '<td valign="top">Interesting view, the dramatic sky works well with the sepia toning...you''ve over-sharpened this one though, as is evident by the light lines along the grids in the window...not necessarily a bad thing, just pointing that out for next time.</td>', 'Interesting view, the dramatic sky works well with the sepia toning...you''ve over-sharpened this one though, as is evident by the light lines along the grids in the window...not necessarily a bad thing, just pointing that out for next time.', '2006-04-29 23:51:49.000000', NULL, 1),
