(2360091, 325137, 15811, '<td valign="top">hrmm the window is nice, but not sure it works here as such a large part of the picture.  It''s like taking over the frame.<br/> <br/>Outside looks nice...very good idea though.</td>', 'hrmm the window is nice, but not sure it works here as such a large part of the picture.  It''s like taking over the frame. Outside looks nice...very good idea though.', '2006-04-29 23:55:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2360092, 324750, 8522, '<td valign="top">No clear point of focus.</td>', 'No clear point of focus.', '2006-04-29 23:55:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2360094, 325108, 37858, '<td valign="top">This is an unusual perspective, nicely executed.</td>', 'This is an unusual perspective, nicely executed.', '2006-04-29 23:55:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2360096, 325092, 15811, '<td valign="top">Yes, the reflections are a bit harsh...and you''re in it too I think...the whole reflection thing is quite distracting to be honest...a polarizer will help to get rid of it.</td>', 'Yes, the reflections are a bit harsh...and you''re in it too I think...the whole reflection thing is quite distracting to be honest...a polarizer will help to get rid of it.', '2006-04-29 23:56:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2360098, 325041, 8522, '<td valign="top">Wonderful, not sure about the filtered post-processed look though. I''d have prefered more detail. It''s the colours and composition that make it great, not the processing.</td>', 'Wonderful, not sure about the filtered post-processed look though. I''d have prefered more detail. It''s the colours and composition that make it great, not the processing.', '2006-04-29 23:56:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2360101, 324107, 8522, '<td valign="top">Smile is definitely on the forced side. Nice composition.</td>', 'Smile is definitely on the forced side. Nice composition.', '2006-04-29 23:57:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2360103, 324343, 8522, '<td valign="top">Shame the sky is washed out.</td>', 'Shame the sky is washed out.', '2006-04-29 23:57:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2360107, 325075, 15811, '<td valign="top">oh wow...you''ve got a great scene there...the fencing doesn''t hurt in the top, but in the bottom, it just gets distracting, like some of that should have been cropped out.<br/> <br/>What a great landscape though, the light is just perfect.  good work.</td>', 'oh wow...you''ve got a great scene there...the fencing doesn''t hurt in the top, but in the bottom, it just gets distracting, like some of that should have been cropped out. What a great landscape though, the light is just perfect.  good work.', '2006-04-29 23:57:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2360109, 324748, 8522, '<td valign="top">What a fantastic view! I''d have liked a little more detail in the sky.</td>', 'What a fantastic view! I''d have liked a little more detail in the sky.', '2006-04-29 23:58:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2360110, 324900, 15811, '<td valign="top">You really have a lot going on in this shot...it''s all rather distracting, not even sure what is supposed to be the main subject.</td>', 'You really have a lot going on in this shot...it''s all rather distracting, not even sure what is supposed to be the main subject.', '2006-04-29 23:58:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2360115, 324359, 8522, '<td valign="top">Not quite abstract enough for this to be an interesting abstract. Needs more compositional interest, but I do like some of the textures and colours.</td>', 'Not quite abstract enough for this to be an interesting abstract. Needs more compositional interest, but I do like some of the textures and colours.', '2006-04-29 23:58:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2360117, 323515, 8522, '<td valign="top">Composition strikes me as chaotic.</td>', 'Composition strikes me as chaotic.', '2006-04-29 23:59:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2360119, 324347, 15811, '<td valign="top">cool shot with a lot of action going on...tells somewhat of a story.  Normally angles work, but with this one, I think stepping to the right and making a triptych out of it would work a bit better...of course you''d have to crop some and make it a good bit wider than tall too.<br/> <br/>That being said, good work, I do enjoy the shot.</td>', 'cool shot with a lot of action going on...tells somewhat of a story.  Normally angles work, but with this one, I think stepping to the right and making a triptych out of it would work a bit better...of course you''d have to crop some and make it a good bit wider than tall too. That being said, good work, I do enjoy the shot.', '2006-04-29 23:59:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2360122, 325108, 8522, '<td valign="top">Intriguing point of view which draws the viewer in.</td>', 'Intriguing point of view which draws the viewer in.', '2006-04-29 23:59:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2360125, 323515, 15811, '<td valign="top">hrmm...compositionall, this shot is really lacking...I''d say think composition when you''re out taking pictures, try and view the final product through your viewfinder as you shoot...think rule of thirds or leading lines...etc...</td>', 'hrmm...compositionall, this shot is really lacking...I''d say think composition when you''re out taking pictures, try and view the final product through your viewfinder as you shoot...think rule of thirds or leading lines...etc...', '2006-04-30 00:00:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2360127, 323620, 8522, '<td valign="top">Lovely colours and I''d love to be there, but the composition does nothing for me here.</td>', 'Lovely colours and I''d love to be there, but the composition does nothing for me here.', '2006-04-30 00:00:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2360128, 324888, 33392, '<td valign="top">Does this ever remind me of college.  Well composed, nice colors too.</td>', 'Does this ever remind me of college.  Well composed, nice colors too.', '2006-04-30 00:00:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2360132, 323467, 8522, '<td valign="top">Lovely use of framing here, it does look massively over-sharpened though. Great colours and textures.</td>', 'Lovely use of framing here, it does look massively over-sharpened though. Great colours and textures.', '2006-04-30 00:00:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2360133, 323897, 33392, '<td valign="top">The light through the window is a little over blown.  Nice idea though.</td>', 'The light through the window is a little over blown.  Nice idea though.', '2006-04-30 00:01:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2360136, 323148, 15811, '<td valign="top">hrmm...I''m not 100% sure the white part of the frame really needs to be included here...it really cuts it in half and blocks a good bit of what I find a really interesting looking scene.  Good exposure and color though outside...good work.</td>', 'hrmm...I''m not 100% sure the white part of the frame really needs to be included here...it really cuts it in half and blocks a good bit of what I find a really interesting looking scene.  Good exposure and color though outside...good work.', '2006-04-30 00:01:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2360137, 325005, 33392, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, beautiful view.</td>', 'Nice composition, beautiful view.', '2006-04-30 00:01:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2360139, 325020, 8522, '<td valign="top">Too much monotony in this composition for my taste.</td>', 'Too much monotony in this composition for my taste.', '2006-04-30 00:02:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2360141, 323364, 33392, '<td valign="top">Did you pose this or just lucky?  Either way, it is a fine composition.</td>', 'Did you pose this or just lucky?  Either way, it is a fine composition.', '2006-04-30 00:02:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2360143, 324885, 15811, '<td valign="top">This is a photo of a window with bread in it...<br/> <br/>It doesn''t really tell a story like it probably could...compositionally, you should think about drawing the viewer into the frame, leading their eye where it should go, and giving it something to rest on.<br/> <br/>A polarizer could help to minimize your reflection that you got of yourself.</td>', 'This is a photo of a window with bread in it... It doesn''t really tell a story like it probably could...compositionally, you should think about drawing the viewer into the frame, leading their eye where it should go, and giving it something to rest on. A polarizer could help to minimize your reflection that you got of yourself.', '2006-04-30 00:03:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2360144, 323746, 33392, '<td valign="top">The light on the wall is a bit harsh, although the window and it''s contents are fine.  Life is a series of compromises.</td>', 'The light on the wall is a bit harsh, although the window and it''s contents are fine.  Life is a series of compromises.', '2006-04-30 00:03:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2360145, 322264, 8522, '<td valign="top">The light and shadow in the foreground don''t appear to have been thought about. Obscuring part of the tree seems accidental. Symmetry can make a photo look like a snapshot if carried out unimaginatively by a beginner.</td>', 'The light and shadow in the foreground don''t appear to have been thought about. Obscuring part of the tree seems accidental. Symmetry can make a photo look like a snapshot if carried out unimaginatively by a beginner.', '2006-04-30 00:03:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2360148, 324103, 15811, '<td valign="top">heh sweet idea.<br/> <br/>I think you left the shot cropped (rotated) as shot...I think if you rotated this so the city was level, it would do wonders for it.</td>', 'heh sweet idea. I think you left the shot cropped (rotated) as shot...I think if you rotated this so the city was level, it would do wonders for it.', '2006-04-30 00:04:09.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(2360149, 324858, 33392, '<td valign="top">Neat idea - he looks as if he is under water.  Good lighting.</td>', 'Neat idea - he looks as if he is under water.  Good lighting.', '2006-04-30 00:04:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2360151, 324573, 8522, '<td valign="top">Very Alice in Wonderland, shame the lower part of the cat isn''t clearer.</td>', 'Very Alice in Wonderland, shame the lower part of the cat isn''t clearer.', '2006-04-30 00:04:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2360152, 325071, 33392, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, nice ideas.  Could be a little straighter.</td>', 'Nice idea, nice ideas.  Could be a little straighter.', '2006-04-30 00:04:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2360155, 325120, 15811, '<td valign="top">It''s really hard to see what''s going on here, all that blurry stuff is super distracting.</td>', 'It''s really hard to see what''s going on here, all that blurry stuff is super distracting.', '2006-04-30 00:04:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2360160, 325136, 8522, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, the composition doesn''t quite feel balanced. Not sure how this benefits from being in black and white, I want to see the colourful flowers!</td>', 'Nice idea, the composition doesn''t quite feel balanced. Not sure how this benefits from being in black and white, I want to see the colourful flowers!', '2006-04-30 00:05:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2360162, 325015, 15811, '<td valign="top">hrmm..interesting, but overprocessed for a large audience to enjoy -- this type of ''art'' really speaks to a select few.  While I enjoy shots like this, they will probably never be up there here anyway.</td>', 'hrmm..interesting, but overprocessed for a large audience to enjoy -- this type of ''art'' really speaks to a select few.  While I enjoy shots like this, they will probably never be up there here anyway.', '2006-04-30 00:05:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2360163, 324359, 33392, '<td valign="top">Not very inspiring.  The focus appears to be on the window itself instead of the landscape.  It doesn''work.</td>', 'Not very inspiring.  The focus appears to be on the window itself instead of the landscape.  It doesn''work.', '2006-04-30 00:05:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2360166, 325046, 15811, '<td valign="top">That''s pretty good...nice exposure for the outside -- I wonder if this would be better with some fill, or later in the day though...</td>', 'That''s pretty good...nice exposure for the outside -- I wonder if this would be better with some fill, or later in the day though...', '2006-04-30 00:06:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2360167, 323708, 13719, '<td valign="top">I love that this is black and white, good choice, very nice tones in the picture</td>', 'I love that this is black and white, good choice, very nice tones in the picture', '2006-04-30 00:06:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2360169, 325061, 8522, '<td valign="top">I love the idea, the composition feels unbalanced though and I wish the cat wasn''t that blurry, it hurts my eyes. Pulling back so we could see a little more of the cat''s face might have worked.</td>', 'I love the idea, the composition feels unbalanced though and I wish the cat wasn''t that blurry, it hurts my eyes. Pulling back so we could see a little more of the cat''s face might have worked.', '2006-04-30 00:06:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2360172, 325134, 33392, '<td valign="top">Don''t you just hate it when the shoes get in the way :)<br/> <br/>I like the sudden color the shoes add - contrasts with the window nicely.</td>', 'Don''t you just hate it when the shoes get in the way :) I like the sudden color the shoes add - contrasts with the window nicely.', '2006-04-30 00:07:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2360175, 323608, 8522, '<td valign="top">Needs more interest. Nice shade of blue/gray though.</td>', 'Needs more interest. Nice shade of blue/gray though.', '2006-04-30 00:07:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2360176, 325136, 13719, '<td valign="top">nice tones in the black and white, lovely picture</td>', 'nice tones in the black and white, lovely picture', '2006-04-30 00:07:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2360183, 324177, 8522, '<td valign="top">Nice expressions, reflections spoil the image... especially on girl''s upper lip area.</td>', 'Nice expressions, reflections spoil the image... especially on girl''s upper lip area.', '2006-04-30 00:08:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2360184, 324614, 13719, '<td valign="top">cool picture, love the city buildings in the background and the clouds</td>', 'cool picture, love the city buildings in the background and the clouds', '2006-04-30 00:08:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2360185, 324750, 33392, '<td valign="top">This doesn''t work well for me.  The challenge is supposed to have the subject framed by a window.  To me, the windows are the subject in this shot.</td>', 'This doesn''t work well for me.  The challenge is supposed to have the subject framed by a window.  To me, the windows are the subject in this shot.', '2006-04-30 00:08:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2360190, 325040, 8522, '<td valign="top">White balance is very orange. Man''s expression seems very threatening.</td>', 'White balance is very orange. Man''s expression seems very threatening.', '2006-04-30 00:09:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2360193, 324876, 33392, '<td valign="top">I hope my daughter never meets this driver.<br/> <br/>Interesting subject, but not a very interesting shot.  The colors (or tones, in this case) aren''t sriking enough to make this work.</td>', 'I hope my daughter never meets this driver. Interesting subject, but not a very interesting shot.  The colors (or tones, in this case) aren''t sriking enough to make this work.', '2006-04-30 00:09:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2360197, 323804, 13719, '<td valign="top">lol, nice find</td>', 'lol, nice find', '2006-04-30 00:09:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2360198, 323172, 8522, '<td valign="top">A little too much soft focus making this too saccharine for my taste. Lovely composition though and well exposed.</td>', 'A little too much soft focus making this too saccharine for my taste. Lovely composition though and well exposed.', '2006-04-30 00:09:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2360200, 324450, 33392, '<td valign="top">You just have to hate power lines.  They hurt this shot.</td>', 'You just have to hate power lines.  They hurt this shot.', '2006-04-30 00:10:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2360202, 325001, 8522, '<td valign="top">Leaning verticals make me feel dizzy. Composition too cluttered.</td>', 'Leaning verticals make me feel dizzy. Composition too cluttered.', '2006-04-30 00:10:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2360205, 325121, 8522, '<td valign="top">Nothing appears to be in focus.</td>', 'Nothing appears to be in focus.', '2006-04-30 00:10:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2360207, 324747, 33392, '<td valign="top">I have never gotten a good shot out of an airplane.  This is pretty crisp.</td>', 'I have never gotten a good shot out of an airplane.  This is pretty crisp.', '2006-04-30 00:10:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2360213, 324573, 13719, '<td valign="top">lol very cool shot</td>', 'lol very cool shot', '2006-04-30 00:11:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2360216, 324789, 33392, '<td valign="top">I like this photo.  The ivy looks like hands holding the window.  It''s a bit off-topic though - isnt'' the subject supposed to be framed by the window?</td>', 'I like this photo.  The ivy looks like hands holding the window.  It''s a bit off-topic though - isnt'' the subject supposed to be framed by the window?', '2006-04-30 00:11:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2360221, 323515, 33392, '<td valign="top">This doesn''t work - the car looks as if it''s in the way instead of being the frame.</td>', 'This doesn''t work - the car looks as if it''s in the way instead of being the frame.', '2006-04-30 00:12:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2360234, 324657, 33392, '<td valign="top">A sureal feel to this.  Almost like something by Salvador Dali.</td>', 'A sureal feel to this.  Almost like something by Salvador Dali.', '2006-04-30 00:14:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2360240, 324890, 33392, '<td valign="top">This works well.  The frame of the windows adds to the picture nicely, and actually makes a nice pun on the words behind.</td>', 'This works well.  The frame of the windows adds to the picture nicely, and actually makes a nice pun on the words behind.', '2006-04-30 00:14:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2360249, 323686, 33392, '<td valign="top">I''m not a big fan of this one.  It feels like somebody stuck a window in the way of an otherwise beautiful view.  It does fit the challenge though.</td>', 'I''m not a big fan of this one.  It feels like somebody stuck a window in the way of an otherwise beautiful view.  It does fit the challenge though.', '2006-04-30 00:15:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2360257, 324453, 33392, '<td valign="top">In some ways I like this, and in others, it is hard on the eyes.  I like the idea and composition, but i think it''s a bit over sharpend or oversaturated.  Either way, it''s hard to pick the plant out of the glass, which is what bothers me.</td>', 'In some ways I like this, and in others, it is hard on the eyes.  I like the idea and composition, but i think it''s a bit over sharpend or oversaturated.  Either way, it''s hard to pick the plant out of the glass, which is what bothers me.', '2006-04-30 00:17:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2360265, 324865, 33392, '<td valign="top">This is ok.  Colors could be a bit more striking.  It''s a bit of a stretch for this competition - the subject is supposed to be framed by the window, not to be the window itself.</td>', 'This is ok.  Colors could be a bit more striking.  It''s a bit of a stretch for this competition - the subject is supposed to be framed by the window, not to be the window itself.', '2006-04-30 00:17:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2360270, 324072, 33392, '<td valign="top">This is nice.  Good colors, just enough light in the frame itself to give it some character.  7</td>', 'This is nice.  Good colors, just enough light in the frame itself to give it some character.  7', '2006-04-30 00:18:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2360276, 324938, 33392, '<td valign="top">Very pretty scene.  I wish there was a bit more of the window frame to provide more depth.</td>', 'Very pretty scene.  I wish there was a bit more of the window frame to provide more depth.', '2006-04-30 00:18:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2360284, 325041, 33392, '<td valign="top">Georgeous sunrise/sunset.  I like the way the kids are in only one pane, and the leading line of the wall pulling drawing you to them.</td>', 'Georgeous sunrise/sunset.  I like the way the kids are in only one pane, and the leading line of the wall pulling drawing you to them.', '2006-04-30 00:20:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2360298, 322130, 57684, '<td valign="top">very nice i took a photo very simalar to this one</td>', 'very nice i took a photo very simalar to this one', '2006-04-30 00:22:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2360304, 324404, 57684, '<td valign="top">nice dude</td>', 'nice dude', '2006-04-30 00:23:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2360358, 323708, 30982, '<td valign="top">A lovely, delightful image with warmth and humanity.</td>', 'A lovely, delightful image with warmth and humanity.', '2006-04-30 00:35:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2360360, 325136, 30982, '<td valign="top">Lovely!  I really like this done in black and white.  Some may say that you should move the vase slightly to the left but I find it very well balanced where it is, due to the shape of the curtain and positioning of the flowers.  The only nit is the slope at the top of the window frame - this could be cropped just below it, or use post processing to correct the perspective.</td>', 'Lovely!  I really like this done in black and white.  Some may say that you should move the vase slightly to the left but I find it very well balanced where it is, due to the shape of the curtain and positioning of the flowers.  The only nit is the slope at the top of the window frame - this could be cropped just below it, or use post processing to correct the perspective.', '2006-04-30 00:36:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2360361, 324946, 30982, '<td valign="top">Sharp, clear, and captivating.</td>', 'Sharp, clear, and captivating.', '2006-04-30 00:36:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2360364, 324804, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very good job with exposure!  Great detail in the child''s face and toy, as well as the window itself.  I can almost see it as a vertical presentation with just half the window, but prefer it square as you''ve done it here.</td>', 'Very good job with exposure!  Great detail in the child''s face and toy, as well as the window itself.  I can almost see it as a vertical presentation with just half the window, but prefer it square as you''ve done it here.', '2006-04-30 00:36:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2360365, 324873, 30982, '<td valign="top">Perfect for the challenge!  The contrasting angles between the two windows work well and I love the simple color scheme.  About the only thing I''d change is to somehow tone down the brightness on the wall on the right.  Nice work.</td>', 'Perfect for the challenge!  The contrasting angles between the two windows work well and I love the simple color scheme.  About the only thing I''d change is to somehow tone down the brightness on the wall on the right.  Nice work.', '2006-04-30 00:36:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2360367, 322356, 30982, '<td valign="top">Great view!  Almost looks like a painting on a wall until you really look closely.  Well composed, well seen.</td>', 'Great view!  Almost looks like a painting on a wall until you really look closely.  Well composed, well seen.', '2006-04-30 00:37:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2360368, 324972, 30982, '<td valign="top">Lovely tones and color.</td>', 'Lovely tones and color.', '2006-04-30 00:37:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2360371, 324110, 30982, '<td valign="top">Well executed!</td>', 'Well executed!', '2006-04-30 00:37:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2360372, 325075, 30982, '<td valign="top">The chickens have an excellent view.  Very nicely seen and captured.</td>', 'The chickens have an excellent view.  Very nicely seen and captured.', '2006-04-30 00:37:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2360378, 324197, 30982, '<td valign="top">What a very inviting room!  Nicely captured.</td>', 'What a very inviting room!  Nicely captured.', '2006-04-30 00:38:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2360386, 325132, 30982, '<td valign="top">Love the tones of this and the single dark chair.  Nicely done.</td>', 'Love the tones of this and the single dark chair.  Nicely done.', '2006-04-30 00:40:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2360399, 324425, 30982, '<td valign="top">Attention to detail here is outstanding.  At first I thought I''d prefer it without the gun (and I still may) but it does create an element of tension compared to their warm and friendly expressions and the overall softness of the picture.</td>', 'Attention to detail here is outstanding.  At first I thought I''d prefer it without the gun (and I still may) but it does create an element of tension compared to their warm and friendly expressions and the overall softness of the picture.', '2006-04-30 00:42:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2360410, 325015, 30982, '<td valign="top">I take it the pane of glass is missing from the lower left?  Very artistic!</td>', 'I take it the pane of glass is missing from the lower left?  Very artistic!', '2006-04-30 00:44:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2360438, 323686, 15711, '<td valign="top">This has a surreal sense with the floating window.  I like it very much.  The shadow it''s casting, and the people behind it create white an interesting vignette.  Nicely done. 8</td>', 'This has a surreal sense with the floating window.  I like it very much.  The shadow it''s casting, and the people behind it create white an interesting vignette.  Nicely done. 8', '2006-04-30 00:52:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2360441, 323533, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the floating frame.  The broken glass and peeling paint just adds more to it.  It might be a touch dark for some, but I appreciate its moodiness and find the whole image quite appealing. 8</td>', 'I like the floating frame.  The broken glass and peeling paint just adds more to it.  It might be a touch dark for some, but I appreciate its moodiness and find the whole image quite appealing. 8', '2006-04-30 00:53:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2360442, 325094, 15711, '<td valign="top">Very nice. the golden; tones of the wall are similar to the sunset color. I like how the two people are balancing INSIDE, the building that we are seeing in the left window OUTSIDE.  Nice job.</td>', 'Very nice. the golden; tones of the wall are similar to the sunset color. I like how the two people are balancing INSIDE, the building that we are seeing in the left window OUTSIDE.  Nice job.', '2006-04-30 00:53:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2360448, 325054, 15711, '<td valign="top">Her overexagerated expression works in the quirkiness of the window suspended in mid air.  Really cute. I like the white on white monochromatic theme of this. Bumping up.</td>', 'Her overexagerated expression works in the quirkiness of the window suspended in mid air.  Really cute. I like the white on white monochromatic theme of this. Bumping up.', '2006-04-30 00:54:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2360452, 324943, 15711, '<td valign="top">Love the grasses and the natural earthy tones.  Beautiful. The window is almost like an apparition.  Very clever.</td>', 'Love the grasses and the natural earthy tones.  Beautiful. The window is almost like an apparition.  Very clever.', '2006-04-30 00:55:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2360459, 325134, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the red shoes.  It shows enough but doesn''t go overboard. Love the old texture of the window against the shiny patent leather shoes and the smooth skin of the woman. Maybe a smidge dark, but a nice image nonetheless. I do like that light contouring her upper right part of the arm.</td>', 'I like the red shoes.  It shows enough but doesn''t go overboard. Love the old texture of the window against the shiny patent leather shoes and the smooth skin of the woman. Maybe a smidge dark, but a nice image nonetheless. I do like that light contouring her upper right part of the arm.', '2006-04-30 00:56:51.000000', NULL, 1),
