(2361526, 325040, 33392, '<td valign="top">I wish you could see his eyes better.  The stare-down that I think is there would really make the shot.  Nice framing.</td>', 'I wish you could see his eyes better.  The stare-down that I think is there would really make the shot.  Nice framing.', '2006-04-30 09:49:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2361538, 323467, 33392, '<td valign="top">Very pretty.  I like the way the sky is in it''s own division.</td>', 'Very pretty.  I like the way the sky is in it''s own division.', '2006-04-30 09:53:27.000000', NULL, 1),
