(2361542, 323148, 33392, '<td valign="top">IMHO, I think it may have worked better with the window opened.  The split doesn''t seem to work as well as if it may have with a single frame.</td>', 'IMHO, I think it may have worked better with the window opened.  The split doesn''t seem to work as well as if it may have with a single frame.', '2006-04-30 09:54:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2361543, 323499, 33392, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.  The blue (whatever it is) on the left is unfortunate.  Nice use of selective desat.</td>', 'Nice idea.  The blue (whatever it is) on the left is unfortunate.  Nice use of selective desat.', '2006-04-30 09:55:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2361547, 324714, 33392, '<td valign="top">Almos surreal, the difference between the frame and the scene.  Maybe a little too extreme.</td>', 'Almos surreal, the difference between the frame and the scene.  Maybe a little too extreme.', '2006-04-30 09:56:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2361548, 325120, 33392, '<td valign="top">An interesting image - confusing, but interesting.  A missing pane?</td>', 'An interesting image - confusing, but interesting.  A missing pane?', '2006-04-30 09:57:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2361550, 324748, 33392, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites thus far.  Nice earth tones, not overdone.  The frame is adequately lit, but not too bright.</td>', 'One of my favorites thus far.  Nice earth tones, not overdone.  The frame is adequately lit, but not too bright.', '2006-04-30 09:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2361555, 324792, 33392, '<td valign="top">One of the few I have come across thus far that used louvres effectively.  They are a little too bright, but not enough to do damage.  Overall, well done.</td>', 'One of the few I have come across thus far that used louvres effectively.  They are a little too bright, but not enough to do damage.  Overall, well done.', '2006-04-30 09:58:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2361559, 324804, 33392, '<td valign="top">Nice child acting.  He really looks bored.  Lighting may be a bit too bright, but a fine shot.</td>', 'Nice child acting.  He really looks bored.  Lighting may be a bit too bright, but a fine shot.', '2006-04-30 09:59:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2361560, 324268, 33392, '<td valign="top">Technically well done, but it doesn''t really grab my attention.</td>', 'Technically well done, but it doesn''t really grab my attention.', '2006-04-30 10:00:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2361566, 325094, 33392, '<td valign="top">If you could''ve moved yourself to the left a bit to center the building a bit more in it''s window, it would''ve been nice, but only you know if that was feasible.  Nice colors.</td>', 'If you could''ve moved yourself to the left a bit to center the building a bit more in it''s window, it would''ve been nice, but only you know if that was feasible.  Nice colors.', '2006-04-30 10:01:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2361568, 325114, 33392, '<td valign="top">It certainly has seen better days.<br/> <br/>I don''t know - the colors or sharpening may be overdone.  Or it may just be the lighting at the moment.  Just seems a bit too contrasty.</td>', 'It certainly has seen better days. I don''t know - the colors or sharpening may be overdone.  Or it may just be the lighting at the moment.  Just seems a bit too contrasty.', '2006-04-30 10:03:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2361571, 324420, 33392, '<td valign="top">Nice visual pun.  The background behind him is way too bright, but I''m sure that couldn''t be helped.  Given the fence I think I see back there, it may be for the better that it is blown out.</td>', 'Nice visual pun.  The background behind him is way too bright, but I''m sure that couldn''t be helped.  Given the fence I think I see back there, it may be for the better that it is blown out.', '2006-04-30 10:04:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2361575, 325068, 33392, '<td valign="top">Interesting...  Where is this?  I don''t recognise the building.  If that is the south carolina flag below the american flag, I''m totally clueless as to where you are.</td>', 'Interesting...  Where is this?  I don''t recognise the building.  If that is the south carolina flag below the american flag, I''m totally clueless as to where you are.', '2006-04-30 10:05:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2361578, 325020, 33392, '<td valign="top">It meets the challenge, but isn''t a very interesting subject.</td>', 'It meets the challenge, but isn''t a very interesting subject.', '2006-04-30 10:06:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2361581, 324730, 33392, '<td valign="top">Clearly a story behind this one.  I hope you told it in your comments.  The frame is a bit bright, but I would assume that you didn''t have much control over that.</td>', 'Clearly a story behind this one.  I hope you told it in your comments.  The frame is a bit bright, but I would assume that you didn''t have much control over that.', '2006-04-30 10:07:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2361585, 324853, 33392, '<td valign="top">I like this.  The sepia colours in only one "frame" works well.</td>', 'I like this.  The sepia colours in only one "frame" works well.', '2006-04-30 10:08:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2361590, 323946, 33392, '<td valign="top">This doesn''t work for me - the subject is supposed to be framed by the window.  In this, the subject seems to be the window..</td>', 'This doesn''t work for me - the subject is supposed to be framed by the window.  In this, the subject seems to be the window..', '2006-04-30 10:09:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2361594, 324979, 33392, '<td valign="top">This is very good.  The primary subjects are blurred, which actually makes the photo.  The almost seem ghost-like.  Good job.</td>', 'This is very good.  The primary subjects are blurred, which actually makes the photo.  The almost seem ghost-like.  Good job.', '2006-04-30 10:10:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2361598, 324793, 33392, '<td valign="top">Good choice of B/W.  A good saw would''ve taken care of that railing :).</td>', 'Good choice of B/W.  A good saw would''ve taken care of that railing :).', '2006-04-30 10:10:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2361602, 324343, 33392, '<td valign="top">A nice idea.  The smooth green lawns interspersed among the buildings is interesting.  Too bad it was an overcast day.  A blue sky would''ve helped.</td>', 'A nice idea.  The smooth green lawns interspersed among the buildings is interesting.  Too bad it was an overcast day.  A blue sky would''ve helped.', '2006-04-30 10:11:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2361610, 323806, 33392, '<td valign="top">You obviously don''t live in florida or kansas...<br/> <br/>I would like to see a shot of this without the window some time.  The contrast of the brown window and the blue-tones of the outdoors is a bit awkward (IMHO).</td>', 'You obviously don''t live in florida or kansas... I would like to see a shot of this without the window some time.  The contrast of the brown window and the blue-tones of the outdoors is a bit awkward (IMHO).', '2006-04-30 10:13:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2361614, 324959, 33392, '<td valign="top">The leading lines of the dress (draped towards the owner) work well.  I wish she was a bit sharper.</td>', 'The leading lines of the dress (draped towards the owner) work well.  I wish she was a bit sharper.', '2006-04-30 10:14:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2361622, 324872, 33392, '<td valign="top">An interesting shot - I''m not sure that I like the cropping.  From experience, I''ve come to believe that a tall, narrow shot doesn''t work well with the format supported on this site.</td>', 'An interesting shot - I''m not sure that I like the cropping.  From experience, I''ve come to believe that a tall, narrow shot doesn''t work well with the format supported on this site.', '2006-04-30 10:15:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2361630, 325138, 33392, '<td valign="top">Not being a cat lover, I''m resisting the urge to yell "Jump!" :)<br/> <br/>The color of the cat against the otherwise black / white photo works for you.</td>', 'Not being a cat lover, I''m resisting the urge to yell "Jump!" :) The color of the cat against the otherwise black / white photo works for you.', '2006-04-30 10:16:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2361635, 324692, 33392, '<td valign="top">Good choice of b/w.</td>', 'Good choice of b/w.', '2006-04-30 10:16:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2361644, 325015, 33392, '<td valign="top">I''m not a big fan of the grunge look.  The single frame not being treated seems strange.  My guess is you will have a lot of 10''s and a lot of low scores on this.  Mine will be a 6.</td>', 'I''m not a big fan of the grunge look.  The single frame not being treated seems strange.  My guess is you will have a lot of 10''s and a lot of low scores on this.  Mine will be a 6.', '2006-04-30 10:18:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2361673, 323708, 40679, '<td valign="top">great choice of black &amp; white and a very nice couple window framed ;)<br/> <br/>your entry looks a bit like mine!</td>', 'great choice of black & white and a very nice couple window framed ;) your entry looks a bit like mine!', '2006-04-30 10:23:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2361695, 324792, 40679, '<td valign="top">it seems like the original photo was a bit underexposed. but I like it anyway! the lines are very nice, and you''ve managed to capture the personality of this person very well. bumping to 8!</td>', 'it seems like the original photo was a bit underexposed. but I like it anyway! the lines are very nice, and you''ve managed to capture the personality of this person very well. bumping to 8!', '2006-04-30 10:27:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2361700, 325136, 40679, '<td valign="top">your window is a bit tilted, but I like your choice of b&amp;w! great contasts.</td>', 'your window is a bit tilted, but I like your choice of b&w! great contasts.', '2006-04-30 10:28:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2361719, 324430, 33392, '<td valign="top">Very artsy - the high grain/ high contrast works well for you.</td>', 'Very artsy - the high grain/ high contrast works well for you.', '2006-04-30 10:30:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2361726, 322985, 33392, '<td valign="top">At first I didn''t like this, but it has grown on me.  The shoes have got to go though.</td>', 'At first I didn''t like this, but it has grown on me.  The shoes have got to go though.', '2006-04-30 10:31:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2361732, 324647, 33392, '<td valign="top">I would like this more if you could''ve killed the interior reflection.  Nice blues and yellows.</td>', 'I would like this more if you could''ve killed the interior reflection.  Nice blues and yellows.', '2006-04-30 10:32:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2361738, 324900, 33392, '<td valign="top">Not one of my favorites.  It fits the challenge, but otherwise just feels cluttered.</td>', 'Not one of my favorites.  It fits the challenge, but otherwise just feels cluttered.', '2006-04-30 10:32:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2361743, 324276, 33392, '<td valign="top">The people are just too dark.  I also don''t get the title.</td>', 'The people are just too dark.  I also don''t get the title.', '2006-04-30 10:33:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2361751, 324703, 33392, '<td valign="top">This fits the challenge nicely, but others have produced better results with this concept.  I think the ruins are a bit overpowered by the framing here.</td>', 'This fits the challenge nicely, but others have produced better results with this concept.  I think the ruins are a bit overpowered by the framing here.', '2006-04-30 10:34:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2361756, 324942, 33392, '<td valign="top">This fits the challenge well.  The subject feels a bit overpowered by the frame, but not to an extreme.</td>', 'This fits the challenge well.  The subject feels a bit overpowered by the frame, but not to an extreme.', '2006-04-30 10:35:26.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(2361762, 324589, 33392, '<td valign="top">I like this.  I would like it more if the dome had fit in the blue frame better, but I know you didn''t have much control over that.  Clean and crisp.</td>', 'I like this.  I would like it more if the dome had fit in the blue frame better, but I know you didn''t have much control over that.  Clean and crisp.', '2006-04-30 10:36:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2361770, 325079, 33392, '<td valign="top">INCOMING!<br/> <br/>Nice idea.  A little cloning of the wire from the top holding the pane would be an improvement.</td>', 'INCOMING! Nice idea.  A little cloning of the wire from the top holding the pane would be an improvement.', '2006-04-30 10:37:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2361775, 325090, 33392, '<td valign="top">Nice colors.  The cross breaking up the shot into multiple frames is nice too.</td>', 'Nice colors.  The cross breaking up the shot into multiple frames is nice too.', '2006-04-30 10:37:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2361786, 324110, 33392, '<td valign="top">I thought that this would be more interesting when I saw the thumbnail.  I like the concept of the selective desat, but something about it here doesn''t seem to work.  I think it would''ve been more effective if only the church''s colors ahd remained.  I think it''s the colored landscape that I am stumbling on.</td>', 'I thought that this would be more interesting when I saw the thumbnail.  I like the concept of the selective desat, but something about it here doesn''t seem to work.  I think it would''ve been more effective if only the church''s colors ahd remained.  I think it''s the colored landscape that I am stumbling on.', '2006-04-30 10:39:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2361791, 325056, 33392, '<td valign="top">I think the focus is on the wrong object here.</td>', 'I think the focus is on the wrong object here.', '2006-04-30 10:39:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2361796, 324943, 33392, '<td valign="top">This is very nice.  Good colors, well composed.  The hint of spring in the few flowers contrasts well with the snow in the mountains.</td>', 'This is very nice.  Good colors, well composed.  The hint of spring in the few flowers contrasts well with the snow in the mountains.', '2006-04-30 10:40:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2361799, 324421, 33392, '<td valign="top">This is very good.  Effective use of a vertical format, nice framing of your subject.</td>', 'This is very good.  Effective use of a vertical format, nice framing of your subject.', '2006-04-30 10:40:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2361807, 324856, 33392, '<td valign="top">A unique take on the challenge.  I hope you didn''t take your hands off the stick for too long.</td>', 'A unique take on the challenge.  I hope you didn''t take your hands off the stick for too long.', '2006-04-30 10:42:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2361810, 324712, 33392, '<td valign="top">This is well done.  Interesting subject, good color, well framed.</td>', 'This is well done.  Interesting subject, good color, well framed.', '2006-04-30 10:42:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2361812, 324141, 33392, '<td valign="top">The window itself overpowers this one.</td>', 'The window itself overpowers this one.', '2006-04-30 10:42:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2361818, 324875, 33392, '<td valign="top">I have learned that the long format doesn''t work well on this site.  This doesn''t do much for me.</td>', 'I have learned that the long format doesn''t work well on this site.  This doesn''t do much for me.', '2006-04-30 10:43:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2361824, 324541, 33392, '<td valign="top">Nice colors, well framed and composed.  The "General Garden" bag is a distraction.</td>', 'Nice colors, well framed and composed.  The "General Garden" bag is a distraction.', '2006-04-30 10:44:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2361826, 324567, 33392, '<td valign="top">An interesting macro, but I cant'' say that your subject is framed by the window..</td>', 'An interesting macro, but I cant'' say that your subject is framed by the window..', '2006-04-30 10:45:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2361827, 325083, 33392, '<td valign="top">It took me a momement to find him.  A bit dark.</td>', 'It took me a momement to find him.  A bit dark.', '2006-04-30 10:45:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2361831, 325017, 33392, '<td valign="top">All smiles.<br/> <br/>Maybe a bit strong on the neat image / smoothing, but that could also be heavy makeup.</td>', 'All smiles. Maybe a bit strong on the neat image / smoothing, but that could also be heavy makeup.', '2006-04-30 10:46:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2361836, 324076, 33392, '<td valign="top">Good use of desat.  I like the old condition of the wood.  The only distraction is the price tag in the middle of the window (which you had no control over).</td>', 'Good use of desat.  I like the old condition of the wood.  The only distraction is the price tag in the middle of the window (which you had no control over).', '2006-04-30 10:47:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2361837, 323804, 33392, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure what to say - humorous, but not very interesting.</td>', 'I''m not sure what to say - humorous, but not very interesting.', '2006-04-30 10:48:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2361840, 324862, 33392, '<td valign="top">Good colors, good contrast with the frame.</td>', 'Good colors, good contrast with the frame.', '2006-04-30 10:48:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2361844, 324021, 33392, '<td valign="top">It is distorted.  I dont'' think that works for you here.</td>', 'It is distorted.  I dont'' think that works for you here.', '2006-04-30 10:48:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2361848, 323172, 33392, '<td valign="top">Nice photo.  Possibly a bit soft, but that probably is intentional.  I wish his eye was a bit sharper.</td>', 'Nice photo.  Possibly a bit soft, but that probably is intentional.  I wish his eye was a bit sharper.', '2006-04-30 10:49:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2361851, 325129, 33392, '<td valign="top">Nice textures.  I''m not sure what is framed by the window here, but that''s ok.</td>', 'Nice textures.  I''m not sure what is framed by the window here, but that''s ok.', '2006-04-30 10:50:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2361856, 324669, 33392, '<td valign="top">The subject is way too small here. I don''t understand what the subject is.</td>', 'The subject is way too small here. I don''t understand what the subject is.', '2006-04-30 10:50:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2361861, 322536, 33392, '<td valign="top">And a nice view indeed.  Nice colors.  A polarizer would really pull out the sky.</td>', 'And a nice view indeed.  Nice colors.  A polarizer would really pull out the sky.', '2006-04-30 10:51:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2361865, 324177, 33392, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, nice colors.  An unfortunate reflection just over the girl''s upper lip.</td>', 'Nice idea, nice colors.  An unfortunate reflection just over the girl''s upper lip.', '2006-04-30 10:51:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2361871, 325054, 33392, '<td valign="top">A good job of cloning out the support lines for the window.  Possibly a bit more light on the background, or pull them further away to reduce the shadows.</td>', 'A good job of cloning out the support lines for the window.  Possibly a bit more light on the background, or pull them further away to reduce the shadows.', '2006-04-30 10:52:58.000000', NULL, 1),
