(2362323, 325078, 27482, '<td valign="top">Sorry but the effect, whatever it is just gives me a headache from looking at this picture, I just want to click "3" and move on to the next photo.  Just thought I should explain the low rating.</td>', 'Sorry but the effect, whatever it is just gives me a headache from looking at this picture, I just want to click "3" and move on to the next photo.  Just thought I should explain the low rating.', '2006-04-30 12:48:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2362325, 324196, 27482, '<td valign="top">Pretty good, should have taken this a bit sooner in the day though and you would have gotten a slightly blue sky in there too, that would have been cool.  6 from me.</td>', 'Pretty good, should have taken this a bit sooner in the day though and you would have gotten a slightly blue sky in there too, that would have been cool.  6 from me.', '2006-04-30 12:49:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2362327, 324139, 27482, '<td valign="top">Like this shot heaps, well composed and I love the colouring in it, the warm tones.  The blurring of the backround is a bit over the top for me though, it´s well done but just too much for my taste.  Gave this a 7.</td>', 'Like this shot heaps, well composed and I love the colouring in it, the warm tones.  The blurring of the backround is a bit over the top for me though, it´s well done but just too much for my taste.  Gave this a 7.', '2006-04-30 12:51:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2362328, 323718, 45318, '<td valign="top">Great shot!</td>', 'Great shot!', '2006-04-30 12:51:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2362329, 324815, 27482, '<td valign="top">Sorry but this has "snapshot" written all over it, doesn´t seem like you put a lot of effort in it.  I think you can do much better!</td>', 'Sorry but this has "snapshot" written all over it, doesn´t seem like you put a lot of effort in it.  I think you can do much better!', '2006-04-30 12:51:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2362331, 324900, 27482, '<td valign="top">Nice but I would have preferred if the horse and that portion of the photo were as sharp as the mirror.</td>', 'Nice but I would have preferred if the horse and that portion of the photo were as sharp as the mirror.', '2006-04-30 12:52:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2362335, 323686, 45318, '<td valign="top">Very inventive. Love it!</td>', 'Very inventive. Love it!', '2006-04-30 12:53:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2362336, 325075, 27482, '<td valign="top">Hehe, this is pretty cool, I love the mesh front and then the rest of the photo.  You got a 9 from me, I like this heaps.</td>', 'Hehe, this is pretty cool, I love the mesh front and then the rest of the photo.  You got a 9 from me, I like this heaps.', '2006-04-30 12:53:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2362337, 324865, 20889, '<td valign="top">Your photo is quite flat, since most of the shot is in the shadows, a small bit of curves made it pop out a bit more. Thus improving the colors.</td>', 'Your photo is quite flat, since most of the shot is in the shadows, a small bit of curves made it pop out a bit more. Thus improving the colors.', '2006-04-30 12:53:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2362339, 324714, 45318, '<td valign="top">I love how the window shutters fram the path and building. Awesome!</td>', 'I love how the window shutters fram the path and building. Awesome!', '2006-04-30 12:54:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2362340, 325041, 45318, '<td valign="top">Great color!</td>', 'Great color!', '2006-04-30 12:55:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2362343, 323467, 45318, '<td valign="top">Love the separation of the sky via window ....</td>', 'Love the separation of the sky via window ....', '2006-04-30 12:55:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2362345, 324792, 45318, '<td valign="top">Fantastic!</td>', 'Fantastic!', '2006-04-30 12:56:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2362346, 324853, 45318, '<td valign="top">Nice idea!</td>', 'Nice idea!', '2006-04-30 12:57:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2362350, 324875, 27482, '<td valign="top">Ah, shame on the city authorities of putting a meter there, it is very out of place.  Like the rest of the shot, looks cool, the grafitti.</td>', 'Ah, shame on the city authorities of putting a meter there, it is very out of place.  Like the rest of the shot, looks cool, the grafitti.', '2006-04-30 12:58:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2362355, 324420, 29177, '<td valign="top">Difficult shot technically, the lights are a tad overexposed... good subject and composition...</td>', 'Difficult shot technically, the lights are a tad overexposed... good subject and composition...', '2006-04-30 13:01:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2362357, 324573, 27482, '<td valign="top">Oooh!  Now I know what a mouse feels like :)</td>', 'Oooh!  Now I know what a mouse feels like :)', '2006-04-30 13:01:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2362361, 324072, 27482, '<td valign="top">Cool window you found there, too bad the sky isn´t breattaking, that would have nailed this shot.</td>', 'Cool window you found there, too bad the sky isn´t breattaking, that would have nailed this shot.', '2006-04-30 13:02:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2362364, 325092, 27482, '<td valign="top">I like how the window separates the trees from the interior of the house.</td>', 'I like how the window separates the trees from the interior of the house.', '2006-04-30 13:03:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2362365, 324445, 29177, '<td valign="top">A window within a window... creative, lovely colors<br/>A bit to over saturated in places, especially on the man''s neck and face otherwise nicely done.</td>', 'A window within a window... creative, lovely colorsA bit to over saturated in places, especially on the man''s neck and face otherwise nicely done.', '2006-04-30 13:03:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2362369, 324982, 27482, '<td valign="top">I like the totally circular window but think it should be more centered in the frame and you should have cropped it to a 1:1 ratio with the circle in the direct middle, this just seems sloppy to me to compose it so that the left part of the window is not in the photo.  Anyway, nice shot except for that.</td>', 'I like the totally circular window but think it should be more centered in the frame and you should have cropped it to a 1:1 ratio with the circle in the direct middle, this just seems sloppy to me to compose it so that the left part of the window is not in the photo.  Anyway, nice shot except for that.', '2006-04-30 13:05:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2362370, 324567, 45745, '<td valign="top">very clear, good macro!</td>', 'very clear, good macro!', '2006-04-30 13:05:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2362371, 324657, 45318, '<td valign="top">Great lighting!</td>', 'Great lighting!', '2006-04-30 13:05:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2362375, 324789, 27482, '<td valign="top">Wow, how wierd is that growth pattern?  Love the colours in this one, the green vs. the blue vs. the tree and sky i the window.  7 from me.</td>', 'Wow, how wierd is that growth pattern?  Love the colours in this one, the green vs. the blue vs. the tree and sky i the window.  7 from me.', '2006-04-30 13:06:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2362378, 324816, 45745, '<td valign="top">I wonder what the rest of the building looks like. Maybe next time dont crop it all out.</td>', 'I wonder what the rest of the building looks like. Maybe next time dont crop it all out.', '2006-04-30 13:07:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2362379, 325015, 45318, '<td valign="top">I love the rawness of this photo! I will be thouroghly surprised if this is not top 2.</td>', 'I love the rawness of this photo! I will be thouroghly surprised if this is not top 2.', '2006-04-30 13:07:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2362380, 323946, 29177, '<td valign="top">The window frame looks too sharp in contrast to the bricks... looks like you created the frame placed it in front of the bricks and blured the bricks in post processing... kinda makes me dizzy looking at it... Points for creativity</td>', 'The window frame looks too sharp in contrast to the bricks... looks like you created the frame placed it in front of the bricks and blured the bricks in post processing... kinda makes me dizzy looking at it... Points for creativity', '2006-04-30 13:07:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2362382, 324865, 45745, '<td valign="top">very nice! i think it could use a little contrast boost and a little saturation on the flowers.</td>', 'very nice! i think it could use a little contrast boost and a little saturation on the flowers.', '2006-04-30 13:08:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2362385, 324856, 45745, '<td valign="top">i''m jellous!</td>', 'i''m jellous!', '2006-04-30 13:09:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2362387, 325015, 29177, '<td valign="top">I do like the effects used and the creativity... however, I think I would have prefered seeing the effect on all the panes of glass..</td>', 'I do like the effects used and the creativity... however, I think I would have prefered seeing the effect on all the panes of glass..', '2006-04-30 13:10:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2362391, 323477, 45745, '<td valign="top">the rest of the reflections distract from the subject</td>', 'the rest of the reflections distract from the subject', '2006-04-30 13:11:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2362393, 325090, 27482, '<td valign="top">Cool colouring, really makes this shot work.  Just wish her front face didn´t blend in with the window post but other than that nitpick, awesome.  8 from me.</td>', 'Cool colouring, really makes this shot work.  Just wish her front face didn´t blend in with the window post but other than that nitpick, awesome.  8 from me.', '2006-04-30 13:11:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2362397, 324343, 27482, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, good composition, just wish the sky wasn´t so washed out.  6 from me.</td>', 'Nice shot, good composition, just wish the sky wasn´t so washed out.  6 from me.', '2006-04-30 13:12:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2362398, 325078, 29177, '<td valign="top">Creative, but the kaleidoscope effect doesnt do anything for me personally... maybe if the subject outside the window were more interesting..</td>', 'Creative, but the kaleidoscope effect doesnt do anything for me personally... maybe if the subject outside the window were more interesting..', '2006-04-30 13:12:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2362404, 324946, 29177, '<td valign="top">Hmmmm, has the treehouse fallen to the ground??? Hope no one was in it! LOL<br/>Really cute shot, nice expression... very nice colors, marginal for me on that being a window, but no points off for using creative license...well exposed although not perfect, nicely done</td>', 'Hmmmm, has the treehouse fallen to the ground??? Hope no one was in it! LOLReally cute shot, nice expression... very nice colors, marginal for me on that being a window, but no points off for using creative license...well exposed although not perfect, nicely done', '2006-04-30 13:16:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2362410, 323746, 29177, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot... not much to critique, technically well done, just no "WOW" factor for me... overall, nicely done</td>', 'Interesting shot... not much to critique, technically well done, just no "WOW" factor for me... overall, nicely done', '2006-04-30 13:18:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2362415, 324902, 45745, '<td valign="top">i like the semmitry in the shapes, i think it needs a little more post prosessing in order to give a little pizaz.</td>', 'i like the semmitry in the shapes, i think it needs a little more post prosessing in order to give a little pizaz.', '2006-04-30 13:20:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2362416, 324876, 29177, '<td valign="top">Definately an original in this challenge! Nice toning, interesting subject, looks a tad overexposed in a couple of areas... extra points for originality...</td>', 'Definately an original in this challenge! Nice toning, interesting subject, looks a tad overexposed in a couple of areas... extra points for originality...', '2006-04-30 13:20:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2362420, 324139, 29177, '<td valign="top">Really cute shot! Not sure I love the extent of the blurring of the background... colors, composition and pose are all great...</td>', 'Really cute shot! Not sure I love the extent of the blurring of the background... colors, composition and pose are all great...', '2006-04-30 13:22:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2362422, 324789, 45745, '<td valign="top">great shot! maybe use the rule of thirds</td>', 'great shot! maybe use the rule of thirds', '2006-04-30 13:23:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2362425, 323897, 29177, '<td valign="top">Love the whimsical nature of the shot... dont love the overexposure of the outside, but it seems as though you intentionally went for that look, so no points off for using creative license...</td>', 'Love the whimsical nature of the shot... dont love the overexposure of the outside, but it seems as though you intentionally went for that look, so no points off for using creative license...', '2006-04-30 13:24:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2362428, 325046, 27482, '<td valign="top">Not really digging the softfocus look on this one but other than that, pretty good.</td>', 'Not really digging the softfocus look on this one but other than that, pretty good.', '2006-04-30 13:24:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2362434, 323364, 29177, '<td valign="top">Great idea, kind of a cluttered shot, so I find myself searching for the subject at first... technically well done, a polerizer might have helped with the reflections in this shot...</td>', 'Great idea, kind of a cluttered shot, so I find myself searching for the subject at first... technically well done, a polerizer might have helped with the reflections in this shot...', '2006-04-30 13:27:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2362440, 324387, 45745, '<td valign="top">haaaa garden of the gods. I usto live in the springs</td>', 'haaaa garden of the gods. I usto live in the springs', '2006-04-30 13:29:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2362443, 324177, 50346, '<td valign="top">You had a great idea here, however I''m drawn to glare about the young girls lips and distracted, perhaps a bit of a polarizer could have cut down on this or PS healing brush, just some suggestions, great photo overall</td>', 'You had a great idea here, however I''m drawn to glare about the young girls lips and distracted, perhaps a bit of a polarizer could have cut down on this or PS healing brush, just some suggestions, great photo overall', '2006-04-30 13:31:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2362447, 324453, 45745, '<td valign="top">just a little too much sat. or some REALLY green plants</td>', 'just a little too much sat. or some REALLY green plants', '2006-04-30 13:31:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2362448, 324984, 27482, '<td valign="top">I think you should have tried to keep the dog´s face in focus, it would have worked so much better.</td>', 'I think you should have tried to keep the dog´s face in focus, it would have worked so much better.', '2006-04-30 13:31:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2362449, 323522, 29177, '<td valign="top">Nice reflection, the colors look a bit muddy, had you run this shot through ''levels'' or the equivalent and played with the ''hue/saturation'' this could have been vastly improved</td>', 'Nice reflection, the colors look a bit muddy, had you run this shot through ''levels'' or the equivalent and played with the ''hue/saturation'' this could have been vastly improved', '2006-04-30 13:32:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2362458, 324872, 27482, '<td valign="top">Sorry but I don´t think the distortion in the window is helping this photo, I don´t particularly fancy it.</td>', 'Sorry but I don´t think the distortion in the window is helping this photo, I don´t particularly fancy it.', '2006-04-30 13:34:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2362459, 324885, 20889, '<td valign="top">A few things you could do to improve your image, one cropping in from the sides removing the silver frames, two adding more contrast, three blurring background object. I used the elliptical marquee tool, by pulling out a nice big circle then inversing it. Then I filled with black paint and blurred it to remove the sharp circle edge. Then you drop the opacity down to about 10%. Give you a better image. Also this helps the viewer focus on the subject.</td>', 'A few things you could do to improve your image, one cropping in from the sides removing the silver frames, two adding more contrast, three blurring background object. I used the elliptical marquee tool, by pulling out a nice big circle then inversing it. Then I filled with black paint and blurred it to remove the sharp circle edge. Then you drop the opacity down to about 10%. Give you a better image. Also this helps the viewer focus on the subject.', '2006-04-30 13:34:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2362461, 323620, 27482, '<td valign="top">Wow, nice view, wish I lived at the beach like that, must be awesome.</td>', 'Wow, nice view, wish I lived at the beach like that, must be awesome.', '2006-04-30 13:35:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2362471, 324076, 50346, '<td valign="top">Lovely photo</td>', 'Lovely photo', '2006-04-30 13:41:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2362480, 325079, 50346, '<td valign="top">Lovely idea, should have cloned out the strings attached to the top, otherwise nicely done, beautiful blue</td>', 'Lovely idea, should have cloned out the strings attached to the top, otherwise nicely done, beautiful blue', '2006-04-30 13:44:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2362494, 324616, 1031, '<td valign="top">If you follow the levels around it forms a spiral leading from the foreground back to the tree -- very nice effect.</td>', 'If you follow the levels around it forms a spiral leading from the foreground back to the tree -- very nice effect.', '2006-04-30 13:47:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2362504, 325012, 1031, '<td valign="top">Nice combination of action and solidity, contrast of straight lines and wavy lines.</td>', 'Nice combination of action and solidity, contrast of straight lines and wavy lines.', '2006-04-30 13:51:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2362510, 324076, 1031, '<td valign="top">Use of the partial desaturation technique makes sense here, and is well-done.</td>', 'Use of the partial desaturation technique makes sense here, and is well-done.', '2006-04-30 13:53:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2362512, 324730, 20889, '<td valign="top">I think you have a powerful image, but the image itself needs some work.<br/>Maybe b&amp;w and some more contrast.</td>', 'I think you have a powerful image, but the image itself needs some work.Maybe b&w and some more contrast.', '2006-04-30 13:53:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2362514, 322356, 29177, '<td valign="top">Wonderful job, selective desat if very nice here, colors and lighting are great, beautiful work</td>', 'Wonderful job, selective desat if very nice here, colors and lighting are great, beautiful work', '2006-04-30 13:54:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2362515, 324714, 37444, '<td valign="top">Cool image. Can''t wait to see how you did it.</td>', 'Cool image. Can''t wait to see how you did it.', '2006-04-30 13:54:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2362516, 324865, 37444, '<td valign="top">Nice image.</td>', 'Nice image.', '2006-04-30 13:55:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2362518, 324420, 20889, '<td valign="top">I read a man and half :-), its a wee bit to bright.</td>', 'I read a man and half :-), its a wee bit to bright.', '2006-04-30 13:55:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2362519, 324885, 29177, '<td valign="top">Well seen and executed, great complimentary colors in the shot... not too cluttered, only one theme of interest, well done!</td>', 'Well seen and executed, great complimentary colors in the shot... not too cluttered, only one theme of interest, well done!', '2006-04-30 13:55:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2362520, 323970, 37444, '<td valign="top">Very cool image.</td>', 'Very cool image.', '2006-04-30 13:56:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2362522, 324139, 37444, '<td valign="top">Nice emotive image.</td>', 'Nice emotive image.', '2006-04-30 13:56:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2362523, 324937, 1031, '<td valign="top">I''m curious about the big bottle full of corks -- is this a wine-making supply shop?</td>', 'I''m curious about the big bottle full of corks -- is this a wine-making supply shop?', '2006-04-30 13:56:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2362525, 324789, 29177, '<td valign="top">I really like this on so many levels... the shape of the ivy simulates the shape of a tree, but looking to the "inside of the tree" through the window, you see the bare tree with only its branches, naked and exposed.. this shot can be so metiphorical... excellent</td>', 'I really like this on so many levels... the shape of the ivy simulates the shape of a tree, but looking to the "inside of the tree" through the window, you see the bare tree with only its branches, naked and exposed.. this shot can be so metiphorical... excellent', '2006-04-30 13:59:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2362527, 324712, 29177, '<td valign="top">Beautiful double silhouette... lovely sky, well done</td>', 'Beautiful double silhouette... lovely sky, well done', '2006-04-30 13:59:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2362528, 324943, 29177, '<td valign="top">Excellent work, well seen and executed.</td>', 'Excellent work, well seen and executed.', '2006-04-30 14:00:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2362533, 324892, 29177, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot... love anything with the ocean ;-) well done, maybe a tad too bright on the waves...</td>', 'Interesting shot... love anything with the ocean ;-) well done, maybe a tad too bright on the waves...', '2006-04-30 14:01:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2362534, 325100, 20889, '<td valign="top">to bad the car reflection is in there and it fairly flat also</td>', 'to bad the car reflection is in there and it fairly flat also', '2006-04-30 14:01:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2362536, 324900, 1031, '<td valign="top">Strong lines/shapes give this an almost abstract feel to it, even with all the objects clearly identifiable. I wonder what it would look like with a significant blur applied.<br/> <br/>Alignment of the reflections of the rock wall and white line with the backgrouns structures is perfect, and helps reinforce the concept of time passing.</td>', 'Strong lines/shapes give this an almost abstract feel to it, even with all the objects clearly identifiable. I wonder what it would look like with a significant blur applied. Alignment of the reflections of the rock wall and white line with the backgrouns structures is perfect, and helps reinforce the concept of time passing.', '2006-04-30 14:02:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2362537, 324968, 20889, '<td valign="top">I like dark images, but there are many who don''t.</td>', 'I like dark images, but there are many who don''t.', '2006-04-30 14:03:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2362545, 324747, 20889, '<td valign="top">Excuse me mister, but could I use your head for a tri pod :-p</td>', 'Excuse me mister, but could I use your head for a tri pod :-p', '2006-04-30 14:05:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2362547, 325054, 27482, '<td valign="top">This is pretty cool, must remember this trick the next time I photograph a wedding.  Is it traditional though to take pictures of just the bride?  Here in Iceland, that is not the case, all photos are of both the bride and groom together, just wondering what is the "norm" where you come from.  9 from me, awesome shot and well lit, technically this is perfect.</td>', 'This is pretty cool, must remember this trick the next time I photograph a wedding.  Is it traditional though to take pictures of just the bride?  Here in Iceland, that is not the case, all photos are of both the bride and groom together, just wondering what is the "norm" where you come from.  9 from me, awesome shot and well lit, technically this is perfect.', '2006-04-30 14:06:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2362561, 325114, 1031, '<td valign="top">An all too-familiar sight I''m afraid, you''ve captured the feel of it pretty well.</td>', 'An all too-familiar sight I''m afraid, you''ve captured the feel of it pretty well.', '2006-04-30 14:09:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2362564, 325095, 1031, '<td valign="top">In interesting (if noisy) view!</td>', 'In interesting (if noisy) view!', '2006-04-30 14:10:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2362567, 324614, 20889, '<td valign="top">To bad there were not more complimentary lines to go with your shape of your window, there are a few, but not many. I do like your perspective.</td>', 'To bad there were not more complimentary lines to go with your shape of your window, there are a few, but not many. I do like your perspective.', '2006-04-30 14:10:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2362585, 324942, 20889, '<td valign="top">This would been a good candidate for some desaturation. Or even shooting a portrait.</td>', 'This would been a good candidate for some desaturation. Or even shooting a portrait.', '2006-04-30 14:19:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2362589, 324196, 20889, '<td valign="top">My favorite place to stay, the Marriott :-P</td>', 'My favorite place to stay, the Marriott :-P', '2006-04-30 14:21:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2362593, 324021, 1031, '<td valign="top">It takes courage to submit a mostly-abstract like this here. This is the kind of shot I would have probably ruined by playing around with Curves until I got some wacky colors : )</td>', 'It takes courage to submit a mostly-abstract like this here. This is the kind of shot I would have probably ruined by playing around with Curves until I got some wacky colors : )', '2006-04-30 14:22:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2362594, 324789, 43405, '<td valign="top">Very nice, reflection works well and contrasts nicely with the wall.</td>', 'Very nice, reflection works well and contrasts nicely with the wall.', '2006-04-30 14:22:49.000000', NULL, 1),
