(2362642, 325134, 50641, '<td valign="top">Girl... close them curtains!  I like your composition, where the cross of the window frame lands.  Good detail on the wood.  But I find the story kind of comical.  She''s in a barn... and all she was wearing was shiny brand new ruby red pumps?  Or is she about to throw them at someone?  Well, I''m sure the fellas will still fall for it ;-)</td>', 'Girl... close them curtains!  I like your composition, where the cross of the window frame lands.  Good detail on the wood.  But I find the story kind of comical.  She''s in a barn... and all she was wearing was shiny brand new ruby red pumps?  Or is she about to throw them at someone?  Well, I''m sure the fellas will still fall for it ;-)', '2006-04-30 14:36:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2362744, 324900, 20889, '<td valign="top">Since really your mirror is more in focus and there is some great spring scenery, you could have cropped away all of the trucks window and this would have got rid of the purple fringing also. This put your mirror on a third. I pull your picture up and play with some ideals to make it better to me.<br/> <br/>So I did channel mixer, then painted back all but the mirror.<br/>Still had some fringing so I just hue and saturation remove the magenta and some blue, these two colors tend to show up in shadows, Then I used selective color to bring on some more color and went to hue and saturation to make it pop some more.<br/> <br/>So now when I look at your picture I go right to the  mirror and then I look at the shape of it and see the nice lines that compliment the shapes of the building as my eyes wonder around I also see the nice color it has, this just my opinion.</td>', 'Since really your mirror is more in focus and there is some great spring scenery, you could have cropped away all of the trucks window and this would have got rid of the purple fringing also. This put your mirror on a third. I pull your picture up and play with some ideals to make it better to me. So I did channel mixer, then painted back all but the mirror.Still had some fringing so I just hue and saturation remove the magenta and some blue, these two colors tend to show up in shadows, Then I used selective color to bring on some more color and went to hue and saturation to make it pop some more. So now when I look at your picture I go right to the  mirror and then I look at the shape of it and see the nice lines that compliment the shapes of the building as my eyes wonder around I also see the nice color it has, this just my opinion.', '2006-04-30 15:00:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2362773, 324141, 20889, '<td valign="top">A little more contrast and try to keep your file size up 150k.<br/> <br/>But you have some nice line also 3 trees and 3 frames of the window and the line compliment the buildings roof top.</td>', 'A little more contrast and try to keep your file size up 150k. But you have some nice line also 3 trees and 3 frames of the window and the line compliment the buildings roof top.', '2006-04-30 15:05:36.000000', NULL, 1),
