(2364051, 324445, 27845, '<td valign="top">Whoa, what a cool echoing of inside and outside looks. You have a double mirror of concepts here. Very well seen! I like the warm colours and the bokeh foreground.</td>', 'Whoa, what a cool echoing of inside and outside looks. You have a double mirror of concepts here. Very well seen! I like the warm colours and the bokeh foreground.', '2006-04-30 18:54:19.000000', NULL, 1),
