(2364157, 324747, 45745, '<td valign="top">good job, it''s hard to get a good shot out of a plane window.</td>', 'good job, it''s hard to get a good shot out of a plane window.', '2006-04-30 19:11:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2364166, 323522, 45745, '<td valign="top">great shot. I think a little more contrast and shadows would make it even better.</td>', 'great shot. I think a little more contrast and shadows would make it even better.', '2006-04-30 19:12:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2364174, 324714, 56579, '<td valign="top">i think a little more saturation would improve the view of the image</td>', 'i think a little more saturation would improve the view of the image', '2006-04-30 19:15:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2364235, 325116, 27845, '<td valign="top">Whoa, I wouldn''t want to experience this scene right now. The shadow cast on the glass from behind makes the secene really spooky, I also like how the window seems dirtyand scratched.</td>', 'Whoa, I wouldn''t want to experience this scene right now. The shadow cast on the glass from behind makes the secene really spooky, I also like how the window seems dirtyand scratched.', '2006-04-30 19:29:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2364240, 324430, 27845, '<td valign="top">Excellent use of reflections AND window framinf. I like the natural noise in the reflection and the ethereal green colour cast. The model''s expression fits the scene really well.</td>', 'Excellent use of reflections AND window framinf. I like the natural noise in the reflection and the ethereal green colour cast. The model''s expression fits the scene really well.', '2006-04-30 19:30:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2364247, 324979, 27845, '<td valign="top">Good timing here. You managed to find the exact moment to capture two separate motions in midway. The silhouetting works well. The car in the door frame is a bit distacting. You might have chosen a longer shutter speed to overexpose that part, and at the same time emphasize the idea of notion.</td>', 'Good timing here. You managed to find the exact moment to capture two separate motions in midway. The silhouetting works well. The car in the door frame is a bit distacting. You might have chosen a longer shutter speed to overexpose that part, and at the same time emphasize the idea of notion.', '2006-04-30 19:31:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2364253, 324139, 27845, '<td valign="top">Hm, in the thumbnail I mistook the girl for a puppet - and I''m still not completely sure. The golden colour cast is really cool, it gives the image a charming touch.</td>', 'Hm, in the thumbnail I mistook the girl for a puppet - and I''m still not completely sure. The golden colour cast is really cool, it gives the image a charming touch.', '2006-04-30 19:33:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2364255, 325134, 20889, '<td valign="top">For me the colors seem flat, needs more contrast.</td>', 'For me the colors seem flat, needs more contrast.', '2006-04-30 19:34:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2364257, 325114, 27845, '<td valign="top">This is the kind of street photography which screams for a good black and white conversion. There are so many details, patterns and texures in this image which add to the composition.</td>', 'This is the kind of street photography which screams for a good black and white conversion. There are so many details, patterns and texures in this image which add to the composition.', '2006-04-30 19:34:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2364261, 325134, 27845, '<td valign="top">The blacks seem a bit washed out. Other than that, good framing, the cross is not too distracting since the shoes are nicely framed by them.</td>', 'The blacks seem a bit washed out. Other than that, good framing, the cross is not too distracting since the shoes are nicely framed by them.', '2006-04-30 19:35:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2364265, 325079, 5391, '<td valign="top">Nicely done.  I sort of find myself wishing there was a big, puffy, cumulous cloud in the middle of the window frame, but it''s a great shot, nonetheless.  7</td>', 'Nicely done.  I sort of find myself wishing there was a big, puffy, cumulous cloud in the middle of the window frame, but it''s a great shot, nonetheless.  7', '2006-04-30 19:36:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2364275, 324872, 20889, '<td valign="top">Nice abstact look, if it was not for your title. I would not have picked up on it right away.</td>', 'Nice abstact look, if it was not for your title. I would not have picked up on it right away.', '2006-04-30 19:38:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2364288, 324943, 20889, '<td valign="top">I had ideal like this, but don''t have the scenery you have, so I threw it out the window. Good job nice photo.</td>', 'I had ideal like this, but don''t have the scenery you have, so I threw it out the window. Good job nice photo.', '2006-04-30 19:40:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2364293, 324876, 5391, '<td valign="top">I just have to give this a 10.  Quirky, original, fun and it works very well photographically.  Nice tonal range, interesting framing, and the monochrome seems to be a bit of an odd "off" color, which adds to the bizarreness of the whole thing.  I''d give this an 11 if I could.</td>', 'I just have to give this a 10.  Quirky, original, fun and it works very well photographically.  Nice tonal range, interesting framing, and the monochrome seems to be a bit of an odd "off" color, which adds to the bizarreness of the whole thing.  I''d give this an 11 if I could.', '2006-04-30 19:41:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2364304, 323806, 5391, '<td valign="top">Clever and well done.  It looks like a photo in back of the window frame - the lighting is very well thought out and well done for such a shot.  Nice symmetry and straight on perspective with good attention to the horizontals and verticals, too.</td>', 'Clever and well done.  It looks like a photo in back of the window frame - the lighting is very well thought out and well done for such a shot.  Nice symmetry and straight on perspective with good attention to the horizontals and verticals, too.', '2006-04-30 19:44:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2364309, 324856, 20889, '<td valign="top">Boy that''s a nice and clear shot, but your horizon is crooked :-P~~~~~</td>', 'Boy that''s a nice and clear shot, but your horizon is crooked :-P~~~~~', '2006-04-30 19:44:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2364354, 324980, 8522, '<td valign="top">Shame that the faces aren''t more clear, nice idea. Composition feels unbalanced.</td>', 'Shame that the faces aren''t more clear, nice idea. Composition feels unbalanced.', '2006-04-30 19:58:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2364357, 324276, 8522, '<td valign="top">Focus is on the rocks rather than on the faces.</td>', 'Focus is on the rocks rather than on the faces.', '2006-04-30 19:59:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2364358, 324072, 8522, '<td valign="top">Object outside the window isn''t clear</td>', 'Object outside the window isn''t clear', '2006-04-30 19:59:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2364365, 324196, 8522, '<td valign="top">White balance gives too much yellow here. Composition not inspired.</td>', 'White balance gives too much yellow here. Composition not inspired.', '2006-04-30 20:00:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2364370, 322130, 8522, '<td valign="top">If you want to make a symmetrical photo, make sure it''s 100% symmetrical.</td>', 'If you want to make a symmetrical photo, make sure it''s 100% symmetrical.', '2006-04-30 20:01:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2364373, 325100, 8522, '<td valign="top">Distortion of glass doesn''t work well on her face.</td>', 'Distortion of glass doesn''t work well on her face.', '2006-04-30 20:01:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2364380, 324984, 8522, '<td valign="top">Would be better if we could see more of the eye, which should be in focus. Composition isn''t thought out, the eyes should be more to the left looking into the rest of the frame.</td>', 'Would be better if we could see more of the eye, which should be in focus. Composition isn''t thought out, the eyes should be more to the left looking into the rest of the frame.', '2006-04-30 20:02:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2364384, 324703, 8522, '<td valign="top">Light is way too harsh, sky is uninteresting. Photo looks slightly wonky.</td>', 'Light is way too harsh, sky is uninteresting. Photo looks slightly wonky.', '2006-04-30 20:03:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2364388, 325132, 8522, '<td valign="top">Almost an interesting abstract collection of shades and lines, but not quite captivating enough.</td>', 'Almost an interesting abstract collection of shades and lines, but not quite captivating enough.', '2006-04-30 20:03:44.000000', NULL, 1),
