(2364423, 324784, 8522, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot, great colours and textures. Windmill is fantastic. Too much weight on the left though in this composition. The ear in the bottom-right pane bothers me. Great expression.</td>', 'Beautiful shot, great colours and textures. Windmill is fantastic. Too much weight on the left though in this composition. The ear in the bottom-right pane bothers me. Great expression.', '2006-04-30 20:09:29.000000', NULL, 1),
