(2365115, 324200, 27482, '<td valign="top">Sorry but this doesn´t meet the challenge as far as I am concerned, where is the window?  Is it that blurred blob behind the bird?  No way of telling.  Anyway, just wanted to explain why I gave this a 1.</td>', 'Sorry but this doesn´t meet the challenge as far as I am concerned, where is the window?  Is it that blurred blob behind the bird?  No way of telling.  Anyway, just wanted to explain why I gave this a 1.', '2006-04-30 22:09:26.000000', NULL, 1),
