(2367952, 324894, 50641, '<td valign="top">I think the focus you achieved is admirable given that it''s such a close-up shot without a macro lens.  You are brave to attempt this sophisticated idea and complex visual  - the camera window with a real window reflected in it. And, in blending the chalenges, you killed 2 birds with one stone... or maybe with 2 apples ;-) My only wish is to be able to see the room window a little more clearly. Oh, and I want an apple ;-)</td>', 'I think the focus you achieved is admirable given that it''s such a close-up shot without a macro lens.  You are brave to attempt this sophisticated idea and complex visual  - the camera window with a real window reflected in it. And, in blending the chalenges, you killed 2 birds with one stone... or maybe with 2 apples ;-) My only wish is to be able to see the room window a little more clearly. Oh, and I want an apple ;-)', '2006-05-01 10:53:10.000000', NULL, 0),
