(2368122, 324793, 14603, '<td valign="top">Cleverly framed and composed.<br/> <br/> Hope you walked up to the castle through the glen rather than driving. I was there a couple of years back and got better pics from the walk up than from the Castle itself.<br/>"The road to nowhere" and the experimental "Once upon a time" were among the day`s shoot.<br/> <br/>I`m enjoying following your trail over Scotland...must remember to have a browse through your portfolio.<br/> <br/>Gordon<br/></td>', 'Cleverly framed and composed.  Hope you walked up to the castle through the glen rather than driving. I was there a couple of years back and got better pics from the walk up than from the Castle itself."The road to nowhere" and the experimental "Once upon a time" were among the day`s shoot. I`m enjoying following your trail over Scotland...must remember to have a browse through your portfolio. Gordon', '2006-05-01 11:46:14.000000', NULL, 0),
