(2368450, 325118, 449, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the feedback. Most of you thought that i should have cropped on the right side and just show the window sil instead of including the outside of the house. i left it because i was afraid that you may not be able to tell it was a window. i did go back and crop it. you were right, i like it better that way too! Thanks.</td>', 'Thanks for the feedback. Most of you thought that i should have cropped on the right side and just show the window sil instead of including the outside of the house. i left it because i was afraid that you may not be able to tell it was a window. i did go back and crop it. you were right, i like it better that way too! Thanks.', '2006-05-01 13:03:54.000000', NULL, 0),
