(2368623, 325121, 2490, '<td valign="top">[[Trading Post Comment]]<br/> <br/>By reading your comment, I know you regret this shot :)  It is always disappointing when we want so badly to submit and it just doesn''t work out well, isn''t it? <br/> <br/>The reflection alone isn''t bad, but it just doesn''t make a lot of sense.  I honestly don''t have a lot of tips to offer for the shot; but I think the stripe down the right hand side of the picture is very distracting.  Just my thoughts :)</td>', '[[Trading Post Comment]] By reading your comment, I know you regret this shot :)  It is always disappointing when we want so badly to submit and it just doesn''t work out well, isn''t it?  The reflection alone isn''t bad, but it just doesn''t make a lot of sense.  I honestly don''t have a lot of tips to offer for the shot; but I think the stripe down the right hand side of the picture is very distracting.  Just my thoughts :)', '2006-05-01 14:01:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(2368644, 324862, 2490, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot, even though you had to physically give up a lot of pixels due to the crop and size limitations.  The horizontal window bar 2/3 of the way up really hurts you, I think.  It is beautifully colorful, but it starts to be confusing after a few seconds of looking at it.  Almost TOO much information.  Good processing and technical shooting, I''m just not sure about the composition.  Obviously you didn''t have a lot of choices if you wanted to include the windown frame.  I didn''t vote on this pic but would have problem given a 6 or 7.</td>', 'I really like this shot, even though you had to physically give up a lot of pixels due to the crop and size limitations.  The horizontal window bar 2/3 of the way up really hurts you, I think.  It is beautifully colorful, but it starts to be confusing after a few seconds of looking at it.  Almost TOO much information.  Good processing and technical shooting, I''m just not sure about the composition.  Obviously you didn''t have a lot of choices if you wanted to include the windown frame.  I didn''t vote on this pic but would have problem given a 6 or 7.', '2006-05-01 14:07:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(2368666, 323565, 37730, '<td valign="top">It is a nice composition of repeating lines and shapes.  A very peaceful capture.  My only concern are a few distracting bright spots but these do not IMO take away from this beautiful photo.</td>', 'It is a nice composition of repeating lines and shapes.  A very peaceful capture.  My only concern are a few distracting bright spots but these do not IMO take away from this beautiful photo.', '2006-05-01 14:19:07.000000', NULL, 0),
