(2372778, 325062, 12448, '<td valign="top">Thank you everyone for your comments, I did debate about entering it or not but decided that since my daughters and I had put so much work into painting the window and everything............NOT!  But seriously, it is a poster, tacked to the outside of my kitchen window.  My oldest daughter stood on a ladder holding a 500 Watt light behind the waterfall while the youngest held the ladder steady.  So that is how it was done.  I do appreciate all the comments received! :)<br/> <br/>Deannda</td>', 'Thank you everyone for your comments, I did debate about entering it or not but decided that since my daughters and I had put so much work into painting the window and everything............NOT!  But seriously, it is a poster, tacked to the outside of my kitchen window.  My oldest daughter stood on a ladder holding a 500 Watt light behind the waterfall while the youngest held the ladder steady.  So that is how it was done.  I do appreciate all the comments received! :) Deannda', '2006-05-02 16:15:06.000000', NULL, 0),
